#: about.php include/global_arrays.php lib/html.php
msgid "About Cacti"
msgstr "Ibyerekeye Cacti"

#: about.php
msgid "Cacti is designed to be a complete graphing solution based on the RRDtool Time Series Database (TSDB) and Graphing solution. Its goal is to make the Network Administrator's job easier by taking care of all the important details necessary to create meaningful Graphs."
msgstr "Cacti yakozwe kugira ngo ibe igisubizo cyuzuye cyo gukora ibishushanyo mbonera gishingiye ku bubiko bw'amakuru bushingiye ku gihe (TSDB) bwa RRDtool no gukora ibishushanyo mbonera. Intego yayo ni ukworohereza Umuyobozi w'umuyoboro mu kazi ke yita ku bisobanuro byose by'ingenzi bikenewe kugira ngo hakorwe Ibishushanyo mbonera bifite ireme."

#: about.php
#, php-format
msgid "Please see the official %sCacti website%s for information on how to use Cacti, get support, and updates."
msgstr "Nyamuneka reba %1$surubuga rwemewe rwa Cacti%2$s kugira ngo ubone amakuru ku buryo bwo gukoresha Cacti, kubona ubufasha, ndetse n'ibishya byavuguruwe."

#: about.php
msgid "Active Developers"
msgstr "Abatunganya porogaramu bakora ubu"

#: about.php
msgid "Developers working on Cacti, its Architecture, Documentation and Future Releases."
msgstr "Abatunganya porogaramu bakora kuri Cacti, Imiterere yayo, Inyandiko zisobanura ndetse n'ibizasohoka mu gihe kizaza."

#: about.php
msgid "Honorable Mentions"
msgstr "Abashimirwa by'umwihariko"

#: about.php
msgid "Contributors to Documentation, QA, Packaging, the Forums and our YouTube page."
msgstr "Abagize uruhare mu gutunganya Inyandiko zisobanura, QA, Gupakira porogaramu, Ibiganiro (Forums) ndetse n'urupapuro rwacu rwa YouTube."

#: about.php
msgid "Emeritus Members"
msgstr "Abanyamuryango b'icyubahiro bahoze bakora"

#: about.php
msgid "Members of the original Cacti Group that have since moved on in their careers.  We continue to wish them the best."
msgstr "Abanyamuryango b'itsinda ryatangije Cacti bakomeje mu yindi mirimo yabo. Dukomeje kubifuriza ibyiza."

#: about.php
msgid "Thanks"
msgstr "Amashimwe"

#: about.php
#, php-format
msgid "A very special thanks to %sTobi Oetiker%s, the creator of %sRRDtool%s and the very popular %sMRTG%s."
msgstr "Turashimira by'umwihariko %1$sTobi Oetiker%2$s, uwahanze %3$sRRDtool%4$s ndetse na %5$sMRTG%6$s ikunzwe cyane."

#: about.php
msgid "The users of Cacti"
msgstr "Abakoresha Cacti"

#: about.php
msgid "Especially anyone who has taken the time to create an issue report, or otherwise help fix a Cacti related problems. Also to anyone who has contributed to supporting Cacti."
msgstr "Cyane cyane umuntu wese wafashe umwanya wo gutanga raporo y'ikibazo, cyangwa ugafasha mu gukemura ibibazo bifitanye isano na Cacti. Ndetse n'umuntu wese wagize uruhare mu gushyigikira Cacti."

#: about.php
msgid "License"
msgstr "Uruhushya"

#: about.php
msgid "Cacti is licensed under the GNU GPL:"
msgstr "Cacti ifite uruhushya rwa GNU GPL:"

#: about.php lib/installer.php
msgid "This program is free software; you can redistribute it and/or modify it under the terms of the GNU General Public License as published by the Free Software Foundation; either version 2 of the License, or (at your option) any later version."
msgstr "Iyi porogaramu ni porogaramu yisanzuye; ushobora kuyikwirakwiza bundi bushya no/cyangwa kuyihindura ukurikije amategeko ya GNU General Public License nk'uko yatangajwe na Free Software Foundation; yaba verisiyo ya 2 y'Uruhushya, cyangwa indi verisiyo iyo ari yo yose yaje nyuma."

#: about.php
msgid "This program is distributed in the hope that it will be useful, but WITHOUT ANY WARRANTY; without even the implied warranty of MERCHANTABILITY or FITNESS FOR A PARTICULAR PURPOSE. See the GNU General Public License for more details."
msgstr "Iyi porogaramu ikwirakwizwa hizerwa ko izagira akamaro, ariko NTA BWISHINGIZI IHAWE; ndetse nta n'ubwishingizi bukubiyemo bw'UBUCURUZI cyangwa BWO GUKORA IGIKORWA RUNAKA CYIHARIYE. Reba GNU General Public License kugira ngo ubone ibisobanuro birambuye."

