msgstr "Kubona mu buryo bwikora mu kongera gutondekanya"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Auto Detect/Set on first Re-Index"
msgstr "Kubona/Gushyiraho mu buryo bwikora mu kongera gutondekanya kwa mbere"

