#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Sets the exponent value on the Y-axis for numbers. Note: This option is deprecated and replaced by the --y-grid option.  In this option, Y-axis grid lines appear at each grid step interval.  Labels are placed every label factor lines."
msgstr "Gena agaciro k'icyikubye ku murongo wa Y ku mibare. Icyitonderwa: Iri hitamo ntirigikoreshwa kandi ryasimbujwe ihitamo rya --y-grid. Muri iri hitamo, imirongo y'urusobe yo ku murongo wa Y igaragara kuri buri ntera y'intambwe y'urusobe. Inyito zishyirwa kuri buri mirongo y'umubare w'inyito."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Unit Exponent Value (--units-exponent)"
msgstr "Agaciro k'icyikubye cy'igipimo (--units-exponent)"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "What unit Cacti should use on the Y-axis. Use 3 to display everything in \"k\" or -6 to display everything in \"u\" (micro)."
msgstr "Igipimo Cacti igomba gukoresha ku murongo wa Y. Koresha 3 kugira ngo werekane byose muri \"k\" cyangwa -6 kugira ngo werekane byose muri \"u\" (mikoro)."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Unit Length (--units-length &lt;length&gt;)"
msgstr "Uburebure bw'igipimo (--units-length &lt;length&gt;)"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "How many digits should RRDtool assume the y-axis labels to be? You may have to use this option to make enough space once you start fiddling with the y-axis labeling."
msgstr "Ni imibare ingahe RRDtool igomba kwemeza ko inyito z'umurongo wa Y zingana? Ushobora gukenera gukoresha iri hitamo kugira ngo ubone umwanya uhagije igihe utangiye guhindagura inyito z'umurongo wa Y."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "No Gridfit (--no-gridfit)"
msgstr "Nta guhuza n'urusobe (--no-gridfit)"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "In order to avoid anti-aliasing blurring effects RRDtool snaps points to device resolution pixels, this results in a crisper appearance. If this is not to your liking, you can use this switch to turn this behavior off.<br><strong>Note: </strong>Gridfitting is turned off for PDF, EPS, SVG output by default."
msgstr "Kugira ngo irinde ibihu byo koroshya imipaka, RRDtool ihuza utudomo na pigiseli z'ubushobozi bw'igikoresho, ibi bigatanga ishusho isobanutse neza. Niba utabikunda, ushobora gukoresha aka gashushanyo ko gufunga kugira ngo uhagarike iyi mikorere.<br><strong>Icyitonderwa: </strong>Guhuza n'urusobe birafunze ku bisohoka bya PDF, EPS, SVG ku buryo bw'ibanze."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Alternative Y Grid (--alt-y-grid)"
msgstr "Urusobe rw'inyongera rwa Y (--alt-y-grid)"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "The algorithm ensures that you always have a grid, that there are enough but not too many grid lines, and that the grid is metric. This parameter will also ensure that you get enough decimals displayed even if your graph goes from 69.998 to 70.001.<br><strong>Note: </strong>This parameter may interfere with --alt-autoscale options."
msgstr "Uburyo bw'imibare bwemeza ko uhora ufite urusobe rw'imirongo, ko hari imirongo y'urusobe ihagije ariko itari myinshi cyane, kandi ko urusobe rukoresha ibipimo bya meteri. Iki kigenga kizanemeza ko ubona imibare ya nyuma y'akitso ihagije yerekanwa nubwo igishushanyo cyawe cyava kuri 69.998 kikagera kuri 70.001.<br><strong>Icyitonderwa: </strong>Iki kigenga gishobora kubangamira amahitamo ya --alt-autoscale."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Axis Options"
msgstr "Amahitamo y'imirongo ngenderwaho"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Right Axis (--right-axis &lt;scale:shift&gt;)"
msgstr "Umurongo ngenderwaho w'iburyo (--right-axis &lt;scale:shift&gt;)"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "A second axis will be drawn to the right of the graph. It is tied to the left axis via the scale and shift parameters."
msgstr "Umurongo ngenderwaho wa kabiri uzashushanywa iburyo bw'igishushanyo. Ufatanijwe n'umurongo ngenderwaho w'ibumoso binyuze mu bigenga by'igipimo n'iyimura."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Right Axis Label (--right-axis-label &lt;string&gt;)"
msgstr "Inyito y'umurongo ngenderwaho w'iburyo (--right-axis-label &lt;string&gt;)"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "The label for the right axis."
msgstr "Inyito y'umurongo ngenderwaho w'iburyo."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Right Axis Format (--right-axis-format &lt;format&gt;)"
msgstr "Imiterere y'umurongo ngenderwaho w'iburyo (--right-axis-format &lt;format&gt;)"

#: include/global_form.php
#, php-format
msgid "By default, the format of the axis labels gets determined automatically.  If you want to do this yourself, use this option with the same %lf arguments you know from the PRINT and GPRINT commands."
msgstr "Ku buryo busanzwe, imiterere y'inyandiko z'imirongo ngenderwaho igenwa mu buryo bwikora. Niba ushaka kubikora ubwawe, koresha iri hitamo hamwe n'ibipimo bya %lf bimwe n'ibyo uzi mu mabwiriza ya PRINT na GPRINT."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Right Axis Formatter (--right-axis-formatter &lt;formatname&gt;)"
msgstr "Igikoresho gihindura imiterere y'umurongo w'iburyo (--right-axis-formatter &lt;formatname&gt;)"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "When you setup the right axis labeling, apply a rule to the data format.  Supported formats include \"numeric\" where data is treated as numeric, \"timestamp\" where values are interpreted as UNIX timestamps (number of seconds since January 1970) and expressed using strftime format (default is \"%Y-%m-%d %H:%M:%S\").  See also --units-length and --right-axis-format.  Finally \"duration\" where values are interpreted as duration in milliseconds.  Formatting follows the rules of valstrfduration qualified PRINT/GPRINT."
msgstr "Iyo utunganya inyandiko z'umurongo w'iburyo, shyira itegeko ku miterere y'amakuru. Imiterere yemewe irimo \"numeric\" aho amakuru afatwa nk'imibare, \"timestamp\" aho uduciro dufatwa nk'igihe cya UNIX (umubare w'amasegonda kuva muri Mutarama 1970) kandi tukagaragazwa hakoreshejwe imiterere ya strftime (imiterere isanzwe ni \"%Y-%m-%d %H:%M:%S\"). Reba kandi --units-length na --right-axis-format. Hanyuma \"duration\" aho uduciro dufatwa nk'igihe mu bimiliyoni by'isegonda (milisegonda). Imiterere ikurikiza amategeko ya valstrfduration yemejwe na PRINT/GPRINT."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Left Axis Formatter (--left-axis-formatter &lt;formatname&gt;)"
msgstr "Igikoresho gihindura imiterere y'umurongo w'ibumoso (--left-axis-formatter &lt;formatname&gt;)"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "When you setup the left axis labeling, apply a rule to the data format.  Supported formats include \"numeric\" where data is treated as numeric, \"timestamp\" where values are interpreted as UNIX timestamps (number of seconds since January 1970) and expressed using strftime format (default is \"%Y-%m-%d %H:%M:%S\").  See also --units-length.  Finally \"duration\" where values are interpreted as duration in milliseconds.  Formatting follows the rules of valstrfduration qualified PRINT/GPRINT."
msgstr "Iyo utunganya inyandiko z'umurongo w'ibumoso, shyira itegeko ku miterere y'amakuru. Imiterere yemewe irimo \"numeric\" aho amakuru afatwa nk'imibare, \"timestamp\" aho uduciro dufatwa nk'igihe cya UNIX (umubare w'amasegonda kuva muri Mutarama 1970) kandi tukagaragazwa hakoreshejwe imiterere ya strftime (imiterere isanzwe ni \"%Y-%m-%d %H:%M:%S\"). Reba kandi --units-length. Hanyuma \"duration\" aho uduciro dufatwa nk'igihe mu bimiliyoni by'isegonda (milisegonda). Imiterere ikurikiza amategeko ya valstrfduration yemejwe na PRINT/GPRINT."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Legend Options"
msgstr "Amahitamo y'ibisobanuro by'igishushanyo"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Auto Padding"
msgstr "Kwongeraho umwanya mu buryo bwikora"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Pad text so that legend and graph data always line up. Note: this could cause graphs to take longer to render because of the larger overhead. Also Auto Padding may not be accurate on all types of graphs, consistent labeling usually helps."
msgstr "Ongeraho umwanya ku nyandiko kugira ngo ibisobanuro n'amakuru y'igishushanyo bihore ku murongo umwe. Icyitonderwa: ibi bishobora gutuma ibishushanyo bitinda kugaragara kubera umutwaro munini. Nanone Kwongeraho umwanya mu buryo bwikora bishobora kudakora neza ku bwoko bwose bw'ibishushanyo, gukoresha inyandiko zihuje ubusanzwe birafasha."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Dynamic Labels (--dynamic-labels)"
msgstr "Inyandiko zihinduka (--dynamic-labels)"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Draw line markers as a line."
msgstr "Shushanya ibimenyetso by'umurongo nk'umurongo."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Force Rules Legend (--force-rules-legend)"
msgstr "Hatiriza ibisobanuro by'amategeko (--force-rules-legend)"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Force the generation of HRULE and VRULE legends."
msgstr "Hatiriza ikorwa ry'ibisobanuro bya HRULE na VRULE."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Tab Width (--tabwidth &lt;pixels&gt;)"
msgstr "Ubugari bw'umwanya wa Tab (--tabwidth &lt;pixels&gt;)"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "By default the tab-width is 40 pixels, use this option to change it."
msgstr "Ku buryo busanzwe ubugari bw'umwanya wa tab ni pikseli 40, koresha iri hitamo kugira ngo ubuhindure."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Legend Position (--legend-position=&lt;position&gt;)"
msgstr "Umwanya w'ibisobanuro by'igishushanyo (--legend-position=&lt;position&gt;)"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Place the legend at the given side of the graph."
msgstr "Shyira ibisobanuro by'igishushanyo ku ruhande rwatanzwe rw'igishushanyo."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Legend Direction (--legend-direction=&lt;direction&gt;)"
msgstr "Icyerekezo cy'ibisobanuro by'igishushanyo (--legend-direction=&lt;direction&gt;)"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Place the legend items in the given vertical order."
msgstr "Shyira ibigize ibisobanuro by'igishushanyo mu buryo bwikurikiranya buhagaze bwatanzwe."

#: include/global_form.php lib/api_aggregate.php lib/html.php
msgid "Graph Item Type"
msgstr "Ubwoko bw'ikigize igishushanyo"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "How data for this item is represented visually on the graph."
msgstr "Uburyo amakuru y'iki kigize igishushanyo agaragaramo ku gishushanyo."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "The data source to use for this graph item."
msgstr "Isoko y'amakuru yo gukoresha kuri iki kigize igishushanyo."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "The color to use for the legend."
msgstr "Ibara ryo gukoresha ku busobanuro bw'ibishushanyo."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Opacity/Alpha Channel"
msgstr "Ukubonerana/Umuyoboro wa Alpha"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "The opacity/alpha channel of the color."
msgstr "Ukubonerana cyangwa umuyoboro wa Alpha w'ibara."

#: include/global_form.php lib/rrd.php
msgid "Consolidation Function"
msgstr "Umumaro w'ihuriro ry'amakuru"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "How data for this item is represented statistically on the graph."
msgstr "Uburyo amakuru y'iki kigize igishushanyo agaragazwa mu mibare ku gishushanyo."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "CDEF Function"
msgstr "Umumaro wa CDEF"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "A CDEF (math) function to apply to this item on the graph or legend."
msgstr "Umumaro wa CDEF (imibare) wo gukoresha kuri iki kigize igishushanyo cyangwa mu bisobanuro."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "VDEF Function"
msgstr "Umumaro wa VDEF"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "A VDEF (math) function to apply to this item on the graph legend."
msgstr "Umumaro wa VDEF (imibare) wo gukoresha kuri iki kigize mu bisobanuro by'igishushanyo."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Shift Data"
msgstr "Kwimura amakuru"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Offset your data on the time axis (x-axis) by the amount specified in the 'value' field."
msgstr "Imura amakuru yawe ku murongo w'igihe (umurongo wa x) hakurikijwe ingano yashyizwe mu mwanya wa 'value'."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "[HRULE|VRULE]: The value of the graph item.<br/> [TICK]: The fraction for the tick line.<br/> [SHIFT]: The time offset in seconds."
msgstr "[HRULE|VRULE]: Agaciro k'ikigize igishushanyo.<br/> [TICK]: Igice cy'umurongo wa tick.<br/> [SHIFT]: Ikinyuranyo cy'igihe mu masegonda."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "GPRINT Type"
msgstr "Ubwoko bwa GPRINT"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "If this graph item is a GPRINT, you can optionally choose another format here. You can define additional types under \"GPRINT Presets\"."
msgstr "Niba iki kigize igishushanyo ari GPRINT, ushobora guhitamo indi miterere hano. Ushobora gushyiraho ubundi bwoko munsi ya \"Imiterere yateguwe ya GPRINT\"."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Text Alignment (TEXTALIGN)"
msgstr "Itunganya ry'inyandiko (TEXTALIGN)"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "All subsequent legend line(s) will be aligned as given here.  You may use this command multiple times in a single graph.  This command does not produce tabular layout.<br/><strong>Note: </strong>You may want to insert a &lt;HR&gt; on the preceding graph item.<br/> <strong>Note: </strong>A &lt;HR&gt; on this legend line will obsolete this setting!"
msgstr "Imirongo yose ikurikira y'ibisobanuro izatunganywa nk'uko byatanzwe hano. Ushobora gukoresha iri bwiriza inshuro nyinshi mu gishushanyo kimwe. Iri bwiriza ntiritanga imiterere y'imbonerahamwe.<br/><strong>Icyitonderwa: </strong>Ushobora gukenera gushyiramo &lt;HR&gt; ku kigize igishushanyo kibanziriza iki.<br/> <strong>Icyitonderwa: </strong>Gushyira &lt;HR&gt; kuri uyu murongo w'ibisobanuro bizatesha agaciro iri genamiterere!"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Text Format"
msgstr "Imiterere y'inyandiko"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Text that will be displayed on the legend for this graph item."
msgstr "Inyandiko izagaragara mu bisobanuro by'iki kigize igishushanyo."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Insert Hard Return"
msgstr "Shyiramo isimbuka ry'umurongo"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Forces the legend to the next line after this item."
msgstr "Bihatiriza ibisobanuro kujya ku murongo ukurikiyeho nyuma y'iki kigize."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Line Width (decimal)"
msgstr "Ubugari bw'umurongo (muri desimali)"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "In case LINE was chosen, specify width of line here.  You must include a decimal precision, for example 2.00"
msgstr "Niba LINE yahiswemo, sobanura hano ubugari bw'umurongo. Ugomba gushyiramo ibice by'ikinyacumi, urugero 2.00"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Dashes (dashes[=on_s[,off_s[,on_s,off_s]...]])"
msgstr "Uturongo ducagaguye (dashes[=on_s[,off_s[,on_s,off_s]...]])"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "The dashes modifier enables dashed line style."
msgstr "Igihindura cya dashes gituma imiterere y'umurongo ucagaguye ikora."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Dash Offset (dash-offset=offset)"
msgstr "Kwimura kw'akarongo gacagaguye (dash-offset=offset)"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "The dash-offset parameter specifies an offset into the pattern at which the stroke begins."
msgstr "Ikiranga cya dash-offset kigaragaza intera yo kwimura mu miterere aho umurongo utangirira."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "The name given to this graph template."
msgstr "Izina ryahawe iyi nyandikorugero y'igishushanyo."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Multiple Instances"
msgstr "Ingero nyinshi"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Check this checkbox if there can be more than one Graph of this type per Device."
msgstr "Shyira akamenyetso muri aka kazu niba hashobora kubaho igishushanyo kirenze kimwe cy'ubu bwoko kuri buri gikoresho."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Test Data Sources"
msgstr "Gerageza amasoko y'amakuru"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Check this checkbox if you wish to test the Data Sources prior to their creation.  With Test Data Sources enabled, if the Data Source does not return valid data, the Graph will not be created.  This setting is important if you wish to have a more generic Device Template that can include more Graph Templates that can be selectively applied depending on the characteristics of the Device itself.  Note: If you have a long running script as a Data Source, the time to create Graphs will be increased."
msgstr "Shyira akamenyetso muri aka kazu niba wifuza kugerageza amasoko y'amakuru mbere yo kuyahanga. Iyo igikorwa cyo kugerageza amasoko y'amakuru gifunguye, niba isoko y'amakuru itatanze amakuru yemewe, igishushanyo ntigihangwa. Iri genamiterere ni ingenzi niba wifuza kugira inyandikorugero y'igikoresho rusange ishobora kubamo inyandikorugero z'ibishushanyo nyinshi zishobora gukoreshwa ku buryo buhitamo bitewe n'imiterere y'igikoresho ubwacyo. Icyitonderwa: Niba ufite inyandikoporogaramu itwara igihe kirekire nk'isoko y'amakuru, igihe cyo guhanga ibishushanyo kiziyongera."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Enter a name for this graph item input, make sure it is something you recognize."
msgstr "Injiza izina ry'iki kinjizwa cy'ikigize igishushanyo, ugenzure ko ari ikintu ushobora kumenya."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Enter a description for this graph item input to describe what this input is used for."
msgstr "Injiza ibisobanuro by'iki kinjizwa cy'ikigize igishushanyo kugira ngo bisobanure icyo iki kinjizwa gikoreshwa."

