msgstr "Uburyo Cacti izakoresha kugira ngo imenye niba igikoresho cyakira kiboneka ngo gisuzumwe. <br><i>ICYITONDERWA: Birasabwa ko, byibura, SNMP ihora ihiswemo.</i>"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "The type of ping packet to sent.  <br><i>NOTE: ICMP on Linux/UNIX requires root privileges.</i>  <br><i>NOTE: TCP Ping Closed - Even if the tcp ping is not successful, the device can be considered UP.</i>"
msgstr "Ubwoko bw'ipaki ya ping yo kohereza. <br><i>ICYITONDERWA: ICMP kuri Linux/UNIX bisaba uburenganzira bwa root.</i> <br><i>ICYITONDERWA: TCP Ping Ifunze - Niyo TCP ping itatsinda, igikoresho gishobora gufatwa nk'IGIKORA (UP).</i>"

