msgstr "Hitamo Imigereka wifuza gushyira mu buryo bwa Debug hatitawe ku igenamiterere ry'Urwego rusanzwe rw'inyandikobikorwa. Amadosiye yose akoreshwa n'uyu mugereka azafatwa nk'ari mu buryo bwa Debug."

#: include/global_settings.php
