#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "A comma delimited list of Device ID's that you wish to be in Debug mode during data collection.  This Debug level is only in place during the Cacti polling process."
msgstr "Urutonde rutandukanijwe n'akitso rwa za ID z'ibikoresho wifuza ko ziba mu buryo bwa Debug mu gihe cyo gukusanya amakuru. Uru rwego rwa Debug rukora gusa mu gihe cy'ikusanyamakuru rya Cacti."

#: include/global_settings.php
