#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Language Support"
msgstr "Gushyigikira indimi"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Choose 'enabled' to allow the localization of Cacti. The strict mode requires that the requested language will also be supported by all plugins being installed at your system. If that's not the fact everything will be displayed in English."
msgstr "Hitamo 'enabled' kugira ngo wemerere ihindurandimi rya Cacti. Uburyo bukomeye (strict mode) busaba ko ururimi rusabwe ruzaba rushyigikiwe n'imigereka yose yashyizwe muri sisitemu yawe. Niba atari uko bimeze byose bizagaragara mu Cyongereza."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Language"
msgstr "Ururimi"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Default language for this system."
msgstr "Ururimi rusanzwe rw'iyi sisitemu."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Auto Language Detection"
msgstr "Kumenya ururimi mu buryo bwikora"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Allow to automatically determine the 'default' language of the user and provide it at login time if that language is supported by Cacti. If disabled, the default language will be in force until the user elects another language."
msgstr "Emera kumenya mu buryo bwikora ururimi rwa 'default' rw'ukoresha no kurutanga igihe cyo kwinjira niba urwo rurimi rushyigikiwe na Cacti. Niba rwahagaritswe, ururimi rusanzwe ruzakomeza gukoreshwa kugeza igihe ukoresha ahisemo urundi rurimi."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Preferred Language Processor"
msgstr "Igikoresho cy'ihindurandimi gihiswemo"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Cacti includes support for multiple alternate Language Translation Processors.  If none is selected Cacti will attempt to use the first one found."
msgstr "Cacti irimo ubufasha bw'ibikoresho byinshi bitandukanye bihindura indimi. Niba nta na kimwe gihiswemo Cacti izagerageza gukoresha icya mbere kibonetse."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Client TimeZone Support"
