msgstr "Erekana gusa ahantu hihariye ku gice (site)"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Show only locations that are available at a devices selected site."
msgstr "Erekana gusa ahantu haboneka ku gice (site) gihiswemo cy'igikoresho."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Has Graphs/Data Sources Checked"
msgstr "Ifite Imbonerahamwe/Inkomoko z'Amakuru byahiswemo"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Should the Has Graphs and Has Data Sources be Checked by Default."
msgstr "Niba Ifite Imbonerahamwe na Ifite Inkomoko z'Amakuru bigomba kuba bihiswemo mu buryo busanzwe."

#: include/global_settings.php utilities.php
msgid "RRDtool Version"
msgstr "Verisiyo ya RRDtool"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The version of RRDtool that you have installed."
msgstr "Verisiyo ya RRDtool washyizeho."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Enable Gradient Support"
msgstr "Fungura ubufasha bwa Gradient"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Enabled Gradient Support for AREA and STACK charts."
msgstr "Yafunguye ubufasha bwa Gradient ku mbonerahamwe za AREA na STACK."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Graph Permission Method"
msgstr "Uburyo bw'uburenganzira ku bishushanyo"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "There are four methods for determining a User's Graph Permissions.  The first is 'Permissive'.  Under the 'Permissive' setting, a User only needs access to either the Graph, Device or Graph Template to gain access to the Graphs that apply to them.  Under 'Restrictive', the User must have access to the Graph, the Device, and the Graph Template to gain access to the Graph.  These first two methods have scalability problems for very large installs.  So, two additional options are available.  They are 'Device Based', which means if you have access to the Device, you get access to it's Graphs.  And lastly 'Graph Template Based', which means if you have access to the 'Graph Template' you get access to all Device Graphs of that Template."
msgstr "Hari uburyo bune bwo kugena uburenganzira bw'ukoresha ku bishushanyo. Ubwa mbere ni 'Bwisanzuye'. Mu igenamiterere rya 'Bwisanzuye', ukoresha akenera gusa uburenganzira ku gishushanyo, ku gikoresho cyangwa ku nyandikorugero y'igishushanyo kugira ngo agere ku bishushanyo bimureba. Mu buryo bwa 'Bukumira', ukoresha agomba kuba afite uburenganzira ku gishushanyo, ku gikoresho, no ku nyandikorugero y'igishushanyo kugira ngo agere ku gishushanyo. Ubu buryo bubiri bwa mbere bugira ibibazo byo kwaguka ku mashyirwamo manini cyane. Ku bw'ibyo, hari ubundi buryo bubiri bw'inyongera. Ubwo ni 'Bushingiye ku gikoresho', bisobanura ko niba ufite uburenganzira ku gikoresho, ubona n'uburenganzira ku bishushanyo byacyo. Hanyuma ubwa nyuma ni 'Bushingiye ku nyandikorugero y'igishushanyo', bisobanura ko niba ufite uburenganzira ku 'Nyandikorugero y'igishushanyo' ubona uburenganzira ku bishushanyo byose by'ibikoresho by'iyo nyandikorugero."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Permissive"
msgstr "Bwisanzuye"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Restrictive"
msgstr "Bukumira"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Device Based"
msgstr "Bushingiye ku gikoresho"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Graph/Data Source Creation Method"
msgstr "Uburyo bwo kurema igishushanyo/isoko y'amakuru"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "If set to Simple, Graphs and Data Sources can only be created from New Graphs.  If Advanced, legacy Graph and Data Source creation is supported."
msgstr "Niba bishyizwe kuri Byoroshye, ibishushanyo n'amasoko y'amakuru bishobora kuremwa gusa binyuze muri Ibishushanyo bishya. Niba ari Byisumbuye, kurema ibishushanyo n'amasoko y'amakuru mu buryo bwa kera biremewe."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Simple"
msgstr "Byoroshye"

#: include/global_settings.php lib/html.php
msgid "Advanced"
msgstr "Byisumbuye"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Show Form/Setting Help Inline"
msgstr "Erekana ubufasha bw'ifishi/igenamiterere imbere mu ipaji"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "When checked, Form and Setting Help will be show inline.  Otherwise it will be presented when hovering over the help button."
msgstr "Iyo bihiswemo, ubufasha bw'ifishi n'igenamiterere buzerekanwa imbere mu ipaji. Bitabaye ibyo, buzerekanwa iyo utunze imbeba kuri buto y'ubufasha."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Local Page Help Only"
msgstr "Ubufasha bw'ipaji buri imbere gusa"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "By default Cacti page help is located at docs.cacti.net.  However, if your system does not have access to the Internet, you may download the documentation locally in HTML format and host it in the 'docs' location of you Cacti server.  If you choose only to leverage the local location for page help documentation, check this checkbox."
msgstr "Ubusanzwe ubufasha bw'ipaji bwa Cacti buboneka kuri docs.cacti.net. Ariko rero, niba sisitemu yawe idafite interineti, ushobora gukuramo inyandiko z'ubufasha mu buryo bwa HTML ukabishyira mu bubiko bwa 'docs' kuri seriveri yawe ya Cacti. Niba uhisemo gukoresha gusa ahari hafi kuri seriveri ku nyandiko z'ubufasha bw'ipaji, shyira akamenyetso muri aka gasanduku."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Deletion Verification"
msgstr "Igenzura ryo gusiba"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Prompt user before item deletion."
msgstr "Baza ukoresha mbere yo gusiba ikintu."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Data Source Preservation Preset"
msgstr "Igenamiterere ry'ibanze ryo kubungabunga isoko y'amakuru"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "When enabled, Cacti will set Radio Button to Delete related Data Sources of a Graph when removing Graphs.  Note: Cacti will not allow the removal of Data Sources if they are used in other Graphs."
msgstr "Iyo bikoreshejwe, Cacti izashyira akabuto k'ihitamo kuri Siba amasoko y'amakuru ajyanye n'igishushanyo mu gihe cyo gukuraho ibishushanyo. Icyitonderwa: Cacti ntizemerera gukurwaho kw'amasoko y'amakuru niba akoreshwa mu bindi bishushanyo."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Graphs Auto Unlock"
msgstr "Gufungura ibishushanyo mu buryo bwikora"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "When enabled, Cacti will not lock Graphs.  This allow a faster manual modification of Data Sources related to a Graph."
msgstr "Iyo bikoreshejwe, Cacti ntizafunga ibishushanyo. Ibi byoroshya guhindura vuba n'intoki amasoko y'amakuru ajyanye n'igishushanyo."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Hide Cacti Dashboard"
msgstr "Hisha ikibaho nyobozi cya Cacti"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "For use with Cacti's External Link Support.  Using this setting, you can hide the Cacti Dashboard, so you can display just your own page."
msgstr "Bikoreshwa hamwe n'ubufasha bw'imiyoboro yo hanze bwa Cacti. Ukoresheje iri genamiterere, ushobora guhisha ikibaho nyobozi cya Cacti, kugira ngo werekane ipaji yawe bwite gusa."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Enable Drag-N-Drop"
msgstr "Koresha ugukurura no gushyira"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Some of Cacti's interfaces support Drag-N-Drop.  If checked this option will be enabled.  Note: For visually impaired user, this option may be disabled."
msgstr "Zimwe mu mbuga za Cacti zishyigikira ugukurura no gushyira. Niba bihiswemo, ubu buryo buzakoreshwa. Icyitonderwa: Ku bakoresha bafite ubumuga bwo kutabona, ubu buryo bushobora guhagarikwa."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Site Security"
msgstr "Umutekano w'urubuga"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Force Connections over HTTPS"
msgstr "Hatira ihuza gukoresha HTTPS"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "When checked, any attempts to access Cacti will be redirected to HTTPS to ensure high security."
msgstr "Iyo bihiswemo, ibigeragezo byose byo kugera kuri Cacti bizoherezwa kuri HTTPS kugira ngo habeho umutekano uhambaye."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Allow Unsafe Remote Data Collector HTTPS"
msgstr "Emera HTTPS idatekanye y'ikikusanya amakuru cyo kure"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Allow the use of Self Signed Certificates and allow the hostname of the Certificate to differ from that of the Remote Data Collector."
msgstr "Emera ikoreshwa ry'impamyabushobozi zisinywe ubwazo kandi wemere ko izina rya mudasobwa ry'impamyabushobozi ritandukana n'iry'ikikusanya amakuru cyo kure."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Allow Unsafe Metacharacters in Data Input Methods"
msgstr "Emera ibimenyetso bidasanzwe bidatekanye mu buryo bwo kwinjiza amakuru"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Historically, Cacti administrators created simple Data Input Methods that include commands like \"ps -ef | grep something | wc -l\" to represent a numeric value for use in Cacti Graphs.  In earlier versions of Cacti, this was permitted.  However, this is an unsafe practice as it is a gateway for third party users to publish insecure Data Templates.  In modern Cacti, these types of practices should be avoided.  However, we provide this option if you have older Data Input Methods that contain these unsafe Meta Characters and have not converted them to local scripts in the 'scripts' directory.  When this option is unchecked, Cacti restricts shell-style metacharacters such as quotation marks, curly brackets, vertical bars, backslashes, and backticks.  Cacti continues to allow greater-than and less-than signs for things like <path_cacti> and for input parameters, but if this option is unchecked, that is the limit of their permitted use."
msgstr "Kera, abayobozi ba Cacti baremaga uburyo bworoshye bwo kwinjiza amakuru burimo amabwiriza nka \"ps -ef | grep something | wc -l\" kugira ngo bahagararire agaciro k'imibare gakoreshwa mu bishushanyo bya Cacti. Muri verisiyo za mbere za Cacti, ibi byari byemewe. Nyamara, ubu ni uburyo budatekanye kuko ari inzira abakoresha bo hanze bashobora kunyuramo bagatangaza inyandikorugero z'amakuru zidafite umutekano. Muri Cacti y'iki gihe, ibikorwa nk'ibi bigomba kwirindwa. Ariko, dutanga ubu buryo niba ufite uburyo bwa kera bwo kwinjiza amakuru bufite ibi bimenyetso bidasanzwe bidatekanye kandi utarabihindura ngo bibe porogaramu z'imbere mu bubiko bwa 'scripts'. Iyo iri hitamo ritatoranyijwe, Cacti ibuza ibimenyetso bidasanzwe bya shell nk'utwuguzo, udukomo, imirongo ihagaritse, imirongo ihengamye isubira inyuma, n'udutonyanga duhengamye. Cacti ikomeza kwemera ibimenyetso byo kuruta no kuba munsi ku bintu nka <path_cacti> no ku bipimo byinjizwa, ariko iyo iri hitamo ritatoranyijwe, aho ni ho ikoreshwa ryabyo ryemewe rigarukira."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Content-Security Script Policy"
msgstr "Politiki y'umutekano w'ibirimo ku nyandiko za porogaramu (Script)"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Controls the script-src CSP policy.  In Nonce Modes, Cacti Plugins that use inline JavaScript must include the nonce attribute from Cacti's builtin function 'CactiSecureHeaders::getNonceAttribute()'. Otherwise, those scripts will be blocked by the browser.  Currently, Cacti only allows reporting on Cacti Plugins that do not properly use Nonce Mode.  In the future, we will allow Administrators to block such plugins from using their inline JavaScript if they are not using Nonces."
msgstr "Igenzura politiki ya CSP ya script-src. Muri Nonce Modes, imigereka ya Cacti ikoresha JavaScript iri mu murongo igomba gushyiramo ikiranga cya nonce kiva mu mikorere yubatswe muri Cacti ya 'CactiSecureHeaders::getNonceAttribute()'. Bitabaye ibyo, izo nyandiko zizahagarikwa na mucukumbuzi. Kuri ubu, Cacti yemera gusa gutanga raporo ku migereka ya Cacti idakoresha neza Nonce Mode. Mu gihe kizaza, tuzemerera abayobozi guhagarika iyo migereka gukoresha JavaScript yayo iri mu murongo niba idakoresha za Nonce."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Allow Non-Nonced Inline JavaScript"
msgstr "Emera JavaScript iri mu murongo itagira Nonce"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Allow both unsafe-eval and Non-Nonced Inline JavaScript"
msgstr "Emera byombi unsafe-eval na JavaScript iri mu murongo itagira Nonce"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Nonce Mode - Reporting Only"
msgstr "Nonce Mode - Gutanga raporo gusa"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "CSP Violation Report URI"
msgstr "URI ya Raporo y'Irenga rya CSP"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "URL where browsers POST CSP violation reports in nonce-report and nonce modes. Leave empty to use <url_path>/csp_report.php. Must contain only safe URL characters."
msgstr "URL aho ba mucukumbuzi bohereza binyuze kuri POST raporo z'ihonyorwa rya CSP mu buryo bwa nonce-report na nonce. Hasige ubusa kugira ngo ukoreshe <url_path>/csp_report.php. Igomba kuba irimo inyuguti za URL zitekanye gusa."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Content-Security Alternate Sources"
msgstr "Inkomoko Zindi za Content-Security"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Space delimited domain names that will be permitted to be accessed outside of the Web Server itself.  This is important for users choosing to use a CDN, or hosting site.  Sources can includes wildcards for example: *.mydomain.com, or a protocol, for example: https://*.example.com.  These Alternate Sources include Image, CSS and JavaScript types only."
msgstr "Amazina ya domain atandukanywa n'umwanya azemererwa kugerwaho hanze ya seriveri y'urubuga ubwayo. Ibi ni ingenzi ku bakoresha bahitamo gukoresha CDN cyangwa urubuga rwakira imbuga. Inkomoko zishobora kuba zirimo ibimenyetso bisimbura nk'urugero: *.mydomain.com, cyangwa porotokole, urugero: https://*.example.com. Izi nkomoko zisimbura zireba ubwoko bw'amashusho, CSS na JavaScript gusa."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "URL where browsers POST CSP violation reports in nonce-report and nonce modes. Leave empty to use /cacti/csp_report.php at the installation root. Must contain only safe URL characters."
msgstr "URL aho za mushakisha zohereza raporo z'ihonyorwa rya CSP ukoresheje POST mu buryo bwa nonce-report na nonce. Bireke birimo ubusa kugira ngo ukoreshe /cacti/csp_report.php ku muzi w'ahashyizwe porogaramu. Igomba kuba irimo inyuguti za URL zitekanye gusa."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Enable Automatic Graph Creation"
msgstr "Emeza Ikorwa Ryikora ry'Imbonerahamwe"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "When disabled, Cacti Automation will not actively create any Graph.  This is useful when adjusting Device settings so as to avoid creating new Graphs each time you save an object.  Invoking Automation Rules manually will still be possible."
msgstr "Iyo bihagaritswe, Ikoramyikorere rya Cacti ntirizakora ku buryo bwihuse Imbonerahamwe iyo ari yo yose. Ibi ni ingirakamaro igihe uhindura amagenamiterere y'Igikoresho kugira ngo wirinde gukora Imbonerahamwe nshya buri gihe ubitse ikintu. Gukoresha Amategeko y'Ikoramyikorere n'intoki bizakomeza gushoboka."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Enable Automatic Tree Item Creation"
msgstr "Emeza Ikorwa Ryikora ry'Ibintu byo mu Giti"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "When disabled, Cacti Automation will not actively create any Tree Item.  This is useful when adjusting Device or Graph settings so as to avoid creating new Tree Entries each time you save an object.  Invoking Rules manually will still be possible."
msgstr "Iyo bihagaritswe, Ikoramyikorere rya Cacti ntirizakora ku buryo bwihuse Ikintu icyo ari cyo cyose cyo mu Giti. Ibi ni ingirakamaro igihe uhindura amagenamiterere y'Igikoresho cyangwa y'Imbonerahamwe kugira ngo wirinde gukora Ibyinjizwa mu Giti bishya buri gihe ubitse ikintu. Gukoresha Amategeko n'intoki bizakomeza gushoboka."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Automation Notification To Email"
msgstr "Imeri Yohererezwa Imenyekanisha ry'Ikoramyikorere"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The Email Address to send Automation Notification Emails to if not specified at the Automation Network level.  If either this field, or the Automation Network value are left blank, Cacti will use the Primary Cacti Admins Email account."
msgstr "Aderesi ya Imeri yo koherezaho Imeri z'Imenyekanisha ry'Ikoramyikorere niba itashyizweho ku rwego rw'Umuyoboro w'Ikoramyikorere. Niba iki gice, cyangwa agaciro k'Umuyoboro w'Ikoramyikorere bisizweho ubusa, Cacti izakoresha konti ya Imeri y'Abayobozi b'Ibanze ba Cacti."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Automation Notification From Name"
msgstr "Izina ry'Uwohereza Imenyekanisha ry'Ikoramyikorere"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The Email Name to use for Automation Notification Emails to if not specified at the Automation Network level.  If either this field, or the Automation Network value are left blank, Cacti will use the system default From Name."
msgstr "Izina rya Imeri rikoreshwa ku Imeri z'Imenyekanisha ry'Ikoramyikorere niba ritashyizweho ku rwego rw'Umuyoboro w'Ikoramyikorere. Niba iki gice, cyangwa agaciro k'Umuyoboro w'Ikoramyikorere bisizweho ubusa, Cacti izakoresha Izina ry'Uwohereza mburabuzi rya sisitemu."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Automation Notification From Email"
msgstr "Imeri y'Uwohereza Imenyekanisha ry'Ikoramyikorere"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The Email Address to use for Automation Notification Emails to if not specified at the Automation Network level.  If either this field, or the Automation Network value are left blank, Cacti will use the system default From Email Address."
