#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Data Collection Enabled"
msgstr "Ikusanya ry'amakuru rifunguye"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "If you wish to stop the polling process completely, uncheck this box."
msgstr "Niba wifuza guhagarika burundu igikorwa cyo gukusanya amakuru (polling), kura ikimenyetso muri aka kazu."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Poller Type"
msgstr "Ubwoko bwa Poller"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The poller type to use.  This setting will take affect at next polling interval."
msgstr "Ubwoko bwa poller bugomba gukoreshwa. Iri genamiterere rizatangira gukurikizwa ku ntera ikurikira yo gukusanya amakuru."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Poller Sync Interval"
msgstr "Intera yo guhuza ya Poller"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The default polling sync interval to use when creating a poller.  This setting will affect how often remote pollers are checked and updated."
msgstr "Intera y'ibanze yo guhuza gukusanya amakuru ikoreshwa igihe uhanga poller. Iri genamiterere rizagira ingaruka ku nshuro za poller za kure zisuzumwa kandi zivugururwa."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The polling interval in use.  This setting will affect how often RRDfiles are checked and updated.  <strong><u>NOTE: If you change this value, you must re-populate the poller cache.  Failure to do so, may result in lost data.</u></strong>"
msgstr "Intera yo gukusanya amakuru ikoreshwa. Iri genamiterere rizagira ingaruka ku nshuro amadosiye ya RRDfiles asuzumwa kandi avugururwa. <strong><u>ICYITONDERWA: Niba uhinduye iki gipimo, ugomba kongera kuzuza ububiko bw'agateganyo bwa poller. Kudakora ibyo bishobora gutera gutakaza amakuru.</u></strong>"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Cron/Daemon Interval"
msgstr "Intera ya Cron/Daemon"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The frequency that the Cacti data collector will be started.  You can use either crontab, a scheduled task (for windows), or the cactid systemd service to control launching the Cacti data collector.  For instructions on using the cactid daemon, review the README.md file in the service directory."
msgstr "Inshuro ikusanyamakuru rya Cacti rizatangizwa. Ushobora gukoresha crontab, igikorwa cyateguwe (kuri Windows), cyangwa serivisi ya cactid systemd kugira ngo ugenzure itangizwa ry'ikusanyamakuru rya Cacti. Ku mabwiriza yo gukoresha cactid daemon, reba dosiye ya README.md iri mu bubiko bwa service."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Balance Process Load"
msgstr "Kuringaniza umutwaro w'ibikorwa"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "If you choose this option, Cacti will attempt to balance the load of each poller process by equally distributing poller items per process."
msgstr "Nuhitamo aya mahitamo, Cacti izagerageza kuringaniza umutwaro wa buri gikorwa cya poller igabanya ku buryo bungana ibintu bya poller kuri buri gikorwa."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Debug Output Width"
msgstr "Ubugari bw'ibisohoka byo gukemura amakosa (Debug)"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "If you choose this option, Cacti will check for output that exceeds Cacti's ability to store it and issue a warning when it finds it."
msgstr "Nuhitamo aya mahitamo, Cacti izasuzuma ibisohoka birenze ubushobozi bwa Cacti bwo kubibika kandi itange umuburo igihe ibibonye."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Remote Agent Timeout"
msgstr "Igihe ntarengwa cy'umukozi wa kure (Remote Agent)"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The amount of time, in seconds, that the Central Cacti web server will wait for a response from the Remote Data Collector to obtain various Device information before abandoning the request.  On Devices that are associated with Data Collectors other than the Central Cacti Data Collector, the Remote Agent must be used to gather Device information."
msgstr "Igihe, mu masegonda, seriveri ya urubuga ya Cacti yo hagati izategereza igisubizo kivuye ku Mukusanya Amakuru wa Kure kugira ngo ibone amakuru atandukanye y'Igikoresho mbere yo kureka isaba. Ku Bikoresho bifitanye isano n'Abakusanya Amakuru batari Umukusanya Amakuru wa Cacti wo hagati, Umukozi wa Kure agomba gukoreshwa mu gukusanya amakuru y'Igikoresho."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Refresh Poller Table Per Cycle"
msgstr "Vugurura imbonerahamwe ya Poller muri buri cyiciro"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "This setting is for a single poller systems only to rebuild the poller output table on each polling cycle to prevent the memory table from swapping on very large systems with large databases that could use swap."
msgstr "Iri genamiterere ni irya sisitemu za poller imwe gusa kugira ngo zisane imbonerahamwe y'ibisohoka bya poller muri buri cyiciro cyo gukusanya amakuru mu rwego rwo kurinda imbonerahamwe y'ububiko (memory table) gukoresha swap kuri sisitemu nini cyane zifite ububiko bunini bw'amakuru bwashobora gukoresha swap."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Disable Resource Cache Replication"
msgstr "Hagarika iyigana ry'ububiko bw'agateganyo bw'ibikoresho"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "By default, the main Cacti Data Collector will cache the entire web site and plugins into a Resource Cache.  Then, periodically the Remote Data Collectors will update themselves with any updates from the main Cacti Data Collector.  This Resource Cache essentially allows Remote Data Collectors to self upgrade.  If you do not wish to use this option, you can disable it using this setting."
msgstr "Ku buryo busanzwe, Umukusanyamakuru mukuru wa Cacti uzabika urubuga rwose n'imigereka mu Bubiko bw'Ibikoresho (Resource Cache). Hanyuma, mu bihe runaka Abakusanyamakuru ba kure bazajya bivugurura bakura ivugurura iryo ari ryo ryose ku Mukusanyamakuru mukuru wa Cacti. Ubu Bubiko bw'Ibikoresho butuma Abakusanyamakuru ba kure bashobora kwivugurura ubwabo. Niba udashaka gukoresha iri hitamo, ushobora kurihagarika ukoresheje iri genamiterere."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "SNMP Behavior"
msgstr "Imyitwarire ya SNMP"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "SNMP Agent Support Enabled"
msgstr "Ubufasha bwa SNMP Agent bwemejwe"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "If this option is checked, Cacti will populate SNMP Agent tables with Cacti device and system information.  It does not enable the SNMP Agent itself."
msgstr "Niba aya mahitamo atoranyijwe, Cacti izuzuza imbonerahamwe za SNMP Agent amakuru y'igikoresho na sisitemu ya Cacti. Ntiyemeza SNMP Agent ubwayo."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Enable MD5 and DES for SNMPv3"
msgstr "Emeza MD5 na DES kuri SNMPv3"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The MD5 authentication and DES privacy algorithms are legacy, weak, and unavailable on hardened (FIPS) PHP and Net-SNMP builds.  When disabled, MD5 and DES are removed from the SNMPv3 Authentication and Privacy Protocol dropdowns shown when editing a Device and in the Automation SNMP Options, leaving only the stronger SHA and AES algorithms."
msgstr "Uburyo bwo kwemeza bwa MD5 n'ubw'ibanga bwa DES ni ubwa kera, buroroshye kandi ntibuboneka kuri PHP na Net-SNMP byakomejwe (FIPS). Iyo buhagaritswe, MD5 na DES bivanwa ku rutonde ruhitamo rwa porotokole yo kwemeza n'iy'ibanga za SNMPv3 bigaragara iyo uhindura igikoresho no mu mahitamo ya SNMP y'ikora ryikora, hagasigara gusa uburyo bukomeye bwa SHA na AES."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Enable Credential Cache"
msgstr "Emeza Ububiko bw'agateganyo bw'ibyangombwa"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Pre-harden and cache SNMPv3 credential arguments once per credential change so each poller process reuses them instead of rebuilding them on every request.  This yields a marginal savings when collecting with SNMPv3 credentials through the Net-SNMP binaries.  The php-snmp extension handles most SNMPv3 gets in-process and bypasses this cache, but the Net-SNMP binaries (and therefore this cache) are still used for SNMP walks, hex output, requests that set a context or engine id, and protocol combinations that the running PHP version does not support.  Enable this if you collect any of those workloads with SNMPv3 credentials."
msgstr "Tegura mbere kandi ubike mu bubiko bw'agateganyo ingingo z'ibyangombwa bya SNMPv3 rimwe kuri buri mpinduka y'ibyangombwa kugira ngo buri gikorwa cy'umukusanyamakuru cyongere kubikoresha aho kongera kubyubaka kuri buri busabe. Ibi bitanga inyungu nto iyo ukusanya ukoresheje ibyangombwa bya SNMPv3 binyuze muri porogaramu za Net-SNMP. Umugereka wa php-snmp utunganya igice kinini cyo kubona SNMPv3 mu gikorwa imbere kandi urenga ubu bubiko bw'agateganyo, ariko porogaramu za Net-SNMP (bityo n'ubu bubiko bw'agateganyo) ziracyakoreshwa ku kugenzura urutonde rwa SNMP (walks), ibisohoka muri hex, ubusabe bushiraho context cyangwa engine id, n'ihuza rya porotokole verisiyo ya PHP iri gukora idashyigikira. Emeza ibi niba ukusanya imwe muri iyo mirimo ukoresheje ibyangombwa bya SNMPv3."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "SNMP Get OID Limit"
msgstr "Umubare ntarengwa wa OID ya SNMP Get"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The default maximum number of SNMP Get OIDs to issue per snmpget request.  For Devices, this setting is controlled at the Device level.  You should only use this setting when using Cacti's SNMP API natively in your scripts or plugins."
msgstr "Umubare ntarengwa usanzwe wa SNMP Get OIDs ugomba gutangwa kuri buri busabe bwa snmpget. Ku bikoresho, iri genamiterere rigengwa ku rwego rw'igikoresho. Ugomba gukoresha iri genamiterere gusa igihe ukoresha SNMP API ya Cacti mu buryo busanzwe mu nyandikobikorwa cyangwa imigereka yawe."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "SNMP Bulkwalk Fetch Size"
msgstr "Ingano y'ibikurwa na SNMP Bulkwalk"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "How many OID's should be returned per snmpbulkwalk request?  For Devices with large SNMP trees, increasing this size will increase re-index performance over a WAN."
msgstr "Ni OID zingahe zigomba kugarurwa kuri buri busabe bwa snmpbulkwalk?  Ku bikoresho bifite ibiti bya SNMP binini, kongera iyi ngano bizongera umuvuduko wo kongera gutondeka kuri WAN."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Disable increasing OID Check"
msgstr "Hagarika isuzuma ryo kwiyongera kwa OID"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Controls disabling check for increasing OID while walking OID tree."
msgstr "Bigenzura guhagarika isuzuma rya OID ziyongera mu gihe ushakisha mu giti cya OID."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Additional Data Collector Settings"
msgstr "Igenamiterere ry'inyongera ry'Umukusanyamakuru"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Invalid Data Logging"
msgstr "Kwandika mu nyandiko amakuru atari yo"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "How would you like the Data Collector output errors logged?  Options include: 'Detailed' which details every error, 'Summary' which provides the number of output errors per Device, and 'None', which does not provide error counts."
msgstr "Urifuza ko amakosa y'ibyavuye mu Mukusanyamakuru yandikwa ate? Amahitamo arimo: 'Birambuye' bisobanura buri kosa mu buryo burambuye, 'Incamake' bitanga umubare w'amakosa y'ibyavuye kuri buri Gikoresho, na 'Ntacyo' bitatanga umubare w'amakosa."

#: include/global_settings.php utilities.php
msgid "Summary"
msgstr "Incamake"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Detailed"
msgstr "Birambuye"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Number of PHP Script Servers"
msgstr "Umubare wa seriveri za PHP Script"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The number of concurrent script server processes to run per spine process.  Settings between 1 and 15 are accepted.  This parameter will help if you are running several threads and script server scripts and is only valid for the spine Data Collector."
msgstr "Umubare w'ibikorwa bya seriveri ya script bikorera icyarimwe kuri buri gikorwa cya spine. Igenamiterere riri hagati ya 1 na 15 riremewe. Iki gipimo kizagufasha niba ukoresha imirongo myinshi (threads) na script za seriveri ya script kandi gikora gusa ku Mukusanyamakuru wa spine."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Script and Script Server Timeout Value"
msgstr "Igiciro cy'igihe ntarengwa cya Script na Seriveri ya Script"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The maximum time that spine will wait on a script to complete.  This timeout value is in seconds and is only valid for the spine Data Collector."
msgstr "Igihe ntarengwa spine izategereza kugira ngo inyandikomikoro irangire. Iki gipimo cy'igihe ntarengwa kiri mu masegonda kandi gikora gusa ku mukusanyamakuru wa spine."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Periodic All Device Re-Index"
msgstr "Kongera gukora urutonde rw'Ibikoresho byose mu bihe runaka"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Re-Index All Device Schedule"
msgstr "Gahunda yo kongera gukora urutonde rw'Ibikoresho byose"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "At what frequency do you wish to Re-Index all Devices.  This Re-Index will occur at midnight at the frequency that you select."
msgstr "Ni ku kihe kigero wifuza kongera gukora urutonde rw'Ibikoresho byose. Uku kongera gukora urutonde kuzajya kuba mu gicuku ku kigero wahisemo."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Weekly on Sunday"
msgstr "Buri cyumweru ku Cyumweru"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Monthly on Sunady"
msgstr "Buri kwezi ku Cyumweru"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Background Timeout and Concurrent Process Settings"
msgstr "Igenamiterere ry'igihe ntarengwa cy'ibikorwa byo mu rwihisho n'ibikorwa bikorera rimwe"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Report Generation Timeout"
msgstr "Igihe ntarengwa cyo gukora raporo"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The maximum amount of time Cacti's Reports Generation script can run without generating a timeout error and being killed."
msgstr "Igihe ntarengwa inyandikomikoro ya Cacti yo gukora raporo ishobora kumara ikora itabonye ikosa ry'igihe ntarengwa ngo ihagarikwe."

#: include/global_settings.php
#, php-format
msgid "%s Minute"
msgstr "Umunota %s"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Data Source Statistics Timeout"
msgstr "Igihe ntarengwa cy'imibare y'isoko y'amakuru"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The maximum amount of time Cacti's Data Source Statistics script can run without generating a timeout error and being killed."
msgstr "Igihe ntarengwa script ya Cacti y'imibare y'isoko y'amakuru ishobora kumara ikora idakoze ikosa ryo kurenza igihe kandi idahagaritswe."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "RRDChecker Timeout"
msgstr "Igihe ntarengwa cya RRDChecker"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The maximum amount of time Cacti's RRDfile check script can run without generating a timeout error and being killed."
msgstr "Igihe ntarengwa inyandikomikoro ya Cacti yo kugenzura RRDfile ishobora kumara ikora itabonye ikosa ry'igihe ntarengwa ngo ihagarikwe."

#: include/global_settings.php
#, php-format
msgid "%s Hour"
msgstr "Isaha %s"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Poller Commands Timeout"
msgstr "Igihe ntarengwa cy'amabwiriza ya Poller"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The maximum amount of time Cacti's Background Commands script can run without generating a timeout error and being killed.  This script will perform tasks such as re-indexing Devices and pruning devices from Remote Data Collectors."
msgstr "Igihe ntarengwa script ya Cacti y'amabwiriza yo inyuma (Background Commands) ishobora kumara ikora idakoze ikosa ryo kurenza igihe kandi idahagaritswe. Iyi script izakora imirimo nk'iyo kongera gukora urutonde rw'Ibikoresho no gukura ibikoresho ku Bakusanyamakuru ba kure."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Poller Command Concurrent Processes"
msgstr "Ibikorwa by'icyarimwe by'amabwiriza ya Poller"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The number of concurrent Poller Command processes.  The will be at most one concurrent command per host within the Poller Command pool."
msgstr "Umubare w'ibikorwa by'icyarimwe by'amabwiriza ya Poller. Hazabaho ubwiriza butarenze bumwe bukorera icyarimwe kuri buri seriveri (host) mu itsinda ry'amabwiriza ya Poller."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "1 Process"
msgstr "Igikorwa 1"

#: include/global_settings.php
#, php-format
msgid "%d Processes"
msgstr "Ibikorwa %d"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Maintenance Background Generation Timeout"
msgstr "Igihe ntarengwa cyo gukora mu nyuma imirimo yo kubungabunga"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The maximum amount of time a Cacti's Maintenance script can run without generating a timeout error and being killed."
msgstr "Igihe ntarengwa script ya Cacti yo kubungabunga ishobora kumara ikora idakoze ikosa ryo kurenza igihe kandi idahagaritswe."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Spikekill Background Generation Timeout"
msgstr "Igihe ntarengwa cyo gukora mu nyuma kwa Spikekill"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The maximum amount of time a Cacti's Spikekill script can run without generating a timeout error and being killed."
msgstr "Igihe ntarengwa script ya Cacti ya Spikekill ishobora kumara ikora idakoze ikosa ryo kurenza igihe kandi idahagaritswe."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Data Collector Defaults"
msgstr "Igenamiterere shingiro ry'umukusanyamakuru"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "These settings are maintained at the Data Collector level.  The values here are only defaults used when first creating a Data Collector."
msgstr "Iri genamiterere ribungabungwa ku rwego rw'Umukusanyamakuru. Agaciro kari hano ni igenamiterere shingiro rikoreshwa gusa iyo uhanga umukusanyamakuru bwa mbere."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Data Collector Processes"
msgstr "Ibikorwa by'Umukusanyamakuru"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The default number of concurrent processes to execute per Data Collector.  NOTE: Starting from Cacti 1.2, this setting is maintained in the Data Collector.  Moving forward, this value is only a preset for the Data Collector.  Using a higher number when using cmd.php will improve performance.  Performance improvements in Spine are best resolved with the threads parameter.  When using Spine, we recommend a lower number and leveraging threads instead.  When using cmd.php, use no more than 2x the number of CPU cores."
msgstr "Umubare shingiro w'ibikorwa bikorera rimwe kuri buri Mukusanyamakuru. ICYITONDERWA: Guhera kuri Cacti 1.2, iri genamiterere ribungabungwa mu Mukusanyamakuru. Kujya imbere, iyi mibare ni igenamiterere ribanziriza ry'Umukusanyamakuru gusa. Gukoresha umubare munini igihe ukoresha cmd.php bizazamura imikorere. Kuzamura imikorere muri Spine bikemurwa neza n'ikigero cya threads. Iyo ukoresha Spine, turagira inama yo gukoresha umubare muto ukifashisha threads aho gukoresha ibikorwa byinshi. Iyo ukoresha cmd.php, ntiwukoreshe ibirenze inshuro 2 z'umubare wa za CPU cores."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Threads per Process"
msgstr "Threads kuri buri gikorwa"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The Default Threads allowed per process.  NOTE: Starting in Cacti 1.2+, this setting is maintained in the Data Collector, and this is simply the Preset.  Using a higher number when using Spine will improve performance.  However, ensure that you have enough MySQL/MariaDB connections to support the following equation: connections = data collectors * processes * (threads + script servers).  You must also ensure that you have enough spare connections for user login connections as well."
msgstr "Umubare shingiro wa Threads wemewe kuri buri gikorwa. ICYITONDERWA: Guhera muri Cacti 1.2+, iri genamiterere ribungabungwa mu Mukusanyamakuru, kandi ibi ni igenamiterere ribanziriza gusa. Gukoresha umubare munini igihe ukoresha Spine bizazamura imikorere. Ariko, menya neza ko ufite imiyoboro ihagije ya MySQL/MariaDB yo gushyigikira iyi nteruro: imiyoboro = abakusanyamakuru * ibikorwa * (threads + seriveri z'inyandikomikoro). Ugomba kandi kumenya neza ko ufite imiyoboro y'inyongera ihagije yo kwinjira kw'abakoresha."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Authentication Method"
msgstr "Uburyo bwo kwemeza umwirondoro"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "<blockquote><i>Built-in Authentication</i> - Cacti handles user authentication, which allows you to create users and give them rights to different areas within Cacti.<br><br><i>Web Basic Authentication</i> - Authentication is handled by the web server. Users can be added or created automatically on first login if the Template User is defined, otherwise the defined guest permissions will be used.<br><br><i>LDAP Authentication</i> - Allows for authentication against a LDAP server. Users will be created automatically on first login if the Template User is defined, otherwise the defined guest permissions will be used.  If PHPs LDAP module is not enabled, LDAP Authentication will not appear as a selectable option.<br><br><i>Multiple LDAP/AD Domain Authentication</i> - Allows administrators to support multiple disparate groups from different LDAP/AD directories to access Cacti resources.  Just as LDAP Authentication, the PHP LDAP module is required to utilize this method.</blockquote>"
msgstr "<blockquote><i>Kwemeza umwirondoro bwubatswemo</i> - Cacti igenzura iyemezwa ry'umwirondoro w'abakoresha, bikakwemerera guhanga abakoresha no kubaha uburenganzira ku bice bitandukanye muri Cacti.<br><br><i>Kwemeza umwirondoro kw'ibanze kwa Web</i> - Kwemeza umwirondoro bikorwa na seriveri ya web. Abakoresha bashobora kongerwamo cyangwa guhangwa mu buryo bwikora igihe binjiye bwa mbere iyo Umukoresha w'icyitegererezo yashyizweho, bitaba ibyo hakoreshwa uburenganzira bw'umushyitsi bwashyizweho.<br><br><i>Kwemeza umwirondoro ukoresheje LDAP</i> - Bituma umwirondoro wemezwa hifashishijwe seriveri ya LDAP. Abakoresha bazahangwa mu buryo bwikora igihe binjiye bwa mbere iyo Umukoresha w'icyitegererezo yashyizweho, bitaba ibyo hakoreshwa uburenganzira bw'umushyitsi bwashyizweho. Niba modile ya LDAP ya PHP itafunguwe, Kwemeza umwirondoro ukoresheje LDAP ntikuzagaragara mu mahitamo ashobora gutoranywa.<br><br><i>Kwemeza umwirondoro kuri domene nyinshi za LDAP/AD</i> - Byemerera abayobozi ba sisitemu gushyigikira amatsinda menshi atandukanye ava mu bubiko bwa LDAP/AD butandukanye kugira ngo bagere ku bikoresho bya Cacti. Kimwe no Kwemeza umwirondoro ukoresheje LDAP, modile ya LDAP ya PHP irakenewe kugira ngo ubu buryo bukoreshwe.</blockquote>"

