msgstr "Uvugurura wa Boost ugabanya za Local Data ID zuzuye mu bice bikurikiranye hafi y'uyu mubare w'imirongo. Local Data ID imwe ntishobora gucibwamo kabiri, bityo igice gishobora kurenga umubare ugamijwe. Gabanya aka gaciro kugira ngo ugabanye ububiko bw'igihe gito (memory) bw'uvugurura n'igihe cyo kubaza. Agaciro gasanzwe ni 50000."

