msgstr "Igihe Boost yohereza amabwiriza yo kuvugurura kuri RRDtool, ntigomba kurenga uburebure ntarengwa bw'ingingo (Maximum Argument Length) bwa sisitemu y'imikorere. Ibi bitandukana bitewe na sisitemu y'imikorere n'urwego rwa kernel. Urugero: Windows 2000 <= 2048, FreeBSD <= 65535, Linux 2.6.22-- <= 131072, Linux 2.6.23++ nta mupaka"

