#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Spike Kill Settings"
msgstr "Igenamiterere ryo gukuraho imizamukire idasanzwe"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Removal Method"
msgstr "Uburyo bwo gukuraho"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "There are two removal methods.  The first, Standard Deviation, will remove any sample that is X number of standard deviations away from the average of samples.  The second method, Variance, will remove any sample that is X% more than the Variance average.  The Variance method takes into account a certain number of 'outliers'.  Those are exceptional samples, like the spike, that need to be excluded from the Variance Average calculation."
msgstr "Hari uburyo bubiri bwo gukuraho.  Ubwa mbere, Itandukaniro risanzwe (Standard Deviation), buzakuraho igipimo cyose kiri kure ho umubare X w'itandukaniro risanzwe ugereranyije n'impuzandengo y'ibipimo.  Uburyo bwa kabiri, Ihindagurika (Variance), buzakuraho igipimo cyose kirenze ho X% impuzandengo y'ihindagurika.  Uburyo bw'ihindagurika bwita ku mubare runaka w'ibipimo bidasanzwe ('outliers').  Ibyo ni ibipimo byihariye, nk'izamuka rikabije, bigomba kuvanwa mu ibarwa ry'Impuzandengo y'Ihindagurika."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Standard Deviation"
msgstr "Ikinyuranyo fatizo"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Variance Based w/Outliers Removed"
msgstr "Ihindagurika hamwe no gukuramo ibipimo bidasanzwe"

#: include/global_settings.php lib/html.php
msgid "Replacement Method"
msgstr "Uburyo bwo gusimbuza"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "There are three replacement methods.  The first method replaces the spike with the average of the data source in question.  The second method replaces the spike with a 'NaN'.  The last replaces the spike with the last known good value found."
msgstr "Hari uburyo butatu bwo gusimbuza. Uburyo bwa mbere busimbuza izamuka rikabije impuzandengo y'isoko y'amakuru ivugwa. Uburyo bwa kabiri busimbuza izamuka rikabije agaciro ka 'NaN'. Uburyo bwa nyuma busimbuza izamuka rikabije agaciro keza ka nyuma kazwi kabonetse."

#: include/global_settings.php lib/html.php
msgid "Average"
msgstr "Impuzandengo"

#: include/global_settings.php lib/html.php
msgid "NaN's"
msgstr "Uduciro twa NaN"

#: include/global_settings.php lib/html.php
msgid "Last Known Good"
msgstr "Agaciro keza ka nyuma kazwi"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Number of Standard Deviations"
msgstr "Umubare w'ibinyuranyo by'ifatizo"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Any value that is this many standard deviations above the average will be excluded.  A good number will be dependent on the type of data to be operated on.  We recommend a number no lower than 5 Standard Deviations."
msgstr "Agaciro ako ari ko kose karengeje uyu mubare w'ibinyuranyo by'ifatizo hejuru y'impuzandengo kazakurwaho. Umubare mwiza uzaterwa n'ubwoko bw'amakuru azakorwaho. Turasaba umubare utari munsi y'ibinyuranyo by'ifatizo 5."

#: include/global_settings.php
#, php-format
msgid "%d Standard Deviations"
msgstr "Ibinyuranyo by'ifatizo %d"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Variance Percentage"
msgstr "Ijanisha ry'ihindagurika"

#: include/global_settings.php
#, php-format
msgid "This value represents the percentage above the adjusted sample average once outliers have been removed from the sample.  For example, a Variance Percentage of 100%% on an adjusted average of 50 would remove any sample above the quantity of 100 from the graph."
msgstr "Aka gaciro kagaragaza ijanisha riri hejuru y'impuzandengo y'ibipimo yahinduwe nyuma y'uko ibipimo bidasanzwe bikuwe mu gipimo.  Nk'urugero, Ijanisha ry'Ihindagurika rya 100%% ku mpuzandengo yahinduwe ya 50 ryakuraho igipimo cyose kiri hejuru y'umubare wa 100 ku gishushanyo."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Variance Number of Outliers"
msgstr "Umubare w'ibipimo bidasanzwe bya Variance"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "This value represents the number of high and low average samples will be removed from the sample set prior to calculating the Variance Average.  If you choose an outlier value of 5, then both the top and bottom 5 averages are removed."
msgstr "Iki gipimo kigaragaza umubare w'impuzandengo z'ibipimo byo hejuru n'ibyo hasi bizakurwa mu itsinda ry'ibipimo mbere yo kubara impuzandengo ya Variance. Niba uhisemo agaciro k'ibipimo bidasanzwe ka 5, impuzandengo 5 zo hejuru na 5 zo hasi zose zizakurwamo."

#: include/global_settings.php
#, php-format
msgid "%d High/Low Samples"
msgstr "Ibipimo %d byo hejuru/hasi"

