#: index.php
msgid "Number of Offline Records:"
msgstr "Umubare w'inyandiko zo hanze y'umurongo:"

#: index.php
msgid "<strong>NOTE:</strong> You are logged into a Remote Data Collector.  When <b>'online'</b>, you will be able to view and control much of the Main Cacti Web Site just as if you were logged into it.  Also, it's important to note that Remote Data Collectors are required to use the Cacti's Performance Boosting Services <b>'On Demand Updating'</b> feature, and we always recommend using Spine.  When the Remote Data Collector is <b>'offline'</b>, the Remote Data Collectors Web Site will contain much less information.  However, it will cache all updates until the Main Cacti Database and Web Server are reachable.  Then it will dump it's Boost table output back to the Main Cacti Database for updating."
msgstr "<strong>ICYITONDERWA:</strong> Winjiye mu Ikusanyamakuru rya Kure. Igihe riri <b>'ku murongo'</b>, uzashobora kureba no kugenzura igice kinini cy'urubuga Nyamukuru rwa Cacti nk'aho winjiye muri rwo. Kandi ni ingenzi kumenya ko Amakusanyamakuru ya Kure asabwa gukoresha uburyo bwa Serivisi zo Kongera Imikorere za Cacti bwa <b>'Kuvugurura Bisabwe'</b>, kandi buri gihe tugira inama yo gukoresha Spine. Igihe Ikusanyamakuru rya Kure riri <b>'hanze y'umurongo'</b>, urubuga rw'Ikusanyamakuru rya Kure ruzaba rufite amakuru make cyane. Icyakora, ruzabika by'agateganyo amavugurura yose kugeza igihe Ububikoshingiro Nyamukuru bwa Cacti na Seriveri y'Urubuga bibonekera. Nyuma ruzohereza ibyavuye mu mbonerahamwe yarwo ya Boost bisubire mu Bubikoshingiro Nyamukuru bwa Cacti kugira ngo bivugururwe."

#: index.php
msgid "<strong>NOTE:</strong> None of the Core Cacti Plugins, to date, have been re-designed to work with Remote Data Collectors.  Therefore, Plugins such as MacTrack, and HMIB, which require direct access to devices will not work with Remote Data Collectors at this time.  However, plugins such as Thold will work so long as the Remote Data Collector is in <b>'online'</b> mode."
msgstr "<strong>ICYITONDERWA:</strong> Nta na kimwe mu Byongera by'ibanze bya Cacti, kugeza ubu, cyavuguruwe ngo gikorane n'Amakusanyamakuru ya Kure. Kubera iyo mpamvu, ibyongera nka MacTrack, na HMIB, bisaba kugera ku bikoresho mu buryo butaziguye ntibizakorana n'Amakusanyamakuru ya Kure muri iki gihe. Icyakora, ibyongera nka Thold bizakora igihe cyose Ikusanyamakuru rya Kure riri mu buryo bwa <b>'ku murongo'</b>."

