#: lib/installer.php
msgid "MySQL - TimeZone Support"
msgstr "MySQL - Gushyigikira Ibice by'Isaha"

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Your MySQL TimeZone database is not populated.  Please populate this database before proceeding."
msgstr "Ububiko bw'amakuru bw'Ibice by'Isaha bwa MySQL bwawe ntiburimo amakuru. Nyamuneka shyira amakuru muri ubu bubiko mbere yo gukomeza."

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Your Cacti database login account does not have access to the MySQL TimeZone database.  Please provide the Cacti database account \"select\" access to the \"time_zone_name\" table in the \"mysql\" database, and populate MySQL's TimeZone information before proceeding."
msgstr "Konti yo kwinjira mu bubiko bw'amakuru bwa Cacti yawe ntiyemerewe kugera ku bubiko bw'amakuru bw'Ibice by'Isaha bwa MySQL. Nyamuneka ha konti y'ububiko bw'amakuru bwa Cacti uburenganzira bwa \"select\" ku mbonerahamwe ya \"time_zone_name\" iri mu bubiko bw'amakuru bwa \"mysql\", kandi ushyiremo amakuru y'Ibice by'Isaha ya MySQL mbere yo gukomeza."

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Your Cacti database account has access to the MySQL TimeZone database and that database is populated with global TimeZone information."
msgstr "Konti y'ububiko bw'amakuru bwa Cacti yawe yemerewe kugera ku bubiko bw'amakuru bw'Ibice by'Isaha bwa MySQL kandi ubwo bubiko bw'amakuru bufite amakuru y'Ibice by'Isaha ku rwego rw'isi."

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "MySQL - Settings"
msgstr "MySQL - Igenamiterere"

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "These MySQL performance tuning settings will help your Cacti system perform better without issues for a longer time."
msgstr "Iri genamiterere ryo kunoza imikorere ya MySQL rizafasha sisitemu yawe ya Cacti gukora neza kurushaho nta bibazo mu gihe kirekire."

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Recommended MySQL System Variable Settings"
msgstr "Igenamiterere Risabwa ry'Ibipimo bya Sisitemu ya MySQL"

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Installation Type"
msgstr "Ubwoko bw'Iyinjiza"

#: lib/installer.php
#, php-format
msgid "Upgrade from <strong>%s</strong> to <strong>%s</strong>"
msgstr "Kuvugurura kuva kuri <strong>%1$s</strong> ujya kuri <strong>%2$s</strong>"

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "In the event of issues, It is highly recommended that you clear your browser cache, closing then reopening your browser (not just the tab Cacti is on) and retrying, before raising an issue with The Cacti Group"
msgstr "Mu gihe habaye ibibazo, birasabwa cyane ko usiba ububiko bw'agateganyo bwa mushakisha yawe, ugafunga hanyuma ukongera ugafungura mushakisha yawe (atari akadirishya Cacti irimo gusa) maze ukongera ukagerageza, mbere yo kugeza ikibazo kuri The Cacti Group"

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "On rare occasions, we have had reports from users who experience some minor issues due to changes in the code.  These issues are caused by the browser retaining pre-upgrade code and whilst we have taken steps to minimise the chances of this, it may still occur.  If you need instructions on how to clear your browser cache, <a href='https://www.refreshyourcache.com' target='_blank'>https://www.refreshyourcache.com/</a> is a good starting point."
msgstr "Mu bihe bidasanzwe, twagiye twakira raporo z'abakoresha bahura n'ibibazo bito bitewe n'impinduka muri kode. Ibi bibazo biterwa na mushakisha igumana kode ya mbere yo kuvugurura kandi nubwo twafashe ingamba zo kugabanya amahirwe yo kubaho kwabyo, birashoboka ko byaba. Niba ukeneye amabwiriza y'uko wasiba ububiko bw'agateganyo bwa mushakisha yawe, <a href='https://www.refreshyourcache.com' target='_blank'>https://www.refreshyourcache.com/</a> ni intangiriro nziza."

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "If after clearing your cache and restarting your browser, you still experience issues, please raise the issue with us and we will try to identify the cause of it."
msgstr "Niba nyuma yo gusiba ububiko bw'agateganyo no kongera gufungura mushakisha yawe, ugikomeza guhura n'ibibazo, nyamuneka tugeze ikibazo kuri twe kandi tuzagerageza kumenya icyabiteye."

#: lib/installer.php
#, php-format
msgid "Downgrade from <strong>%s</strong> to <strong>%s</strong>"
msgstr "Gusubiza inyuma kuva kuri <strong>%1$s</strong> ujya kuri <strong>%2$s</strong>"

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "You appear to be downgrading to a previous version.  Database changes made for the newer version will not be reversed and <i>could</i> cause issues."
msgstr "Ugaragara nk'uri gusubiza inyuma kuri verisiyo yabanje. Impinduka zakozwe mu bubiko bw'amakuru kuri verisiyo nshya ntizizasubizwa inyuma kandi <i>bishobora</i> gutera ibibazo."

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Please select the type of installation"
msgstr "Nyamuneka hitamo ubwoko bw'iyinjiza"

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Installation options:"
msgstr "Amahitamo y'iyinjiza:"

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Choose this for the Primary site."
msgstr "Hitamo iki ku hantu h'Ibanze."

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "New Primary Server"
msgstr "Seriveri Nshya y'Ibanze"

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "New Remote Poller"
msgstr "Poller Nshya ya Kure"

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Remote Pollers are used to access networks that are not readily accessible to the Primary site."
msgstr "Poller za Kure zikoreshwa mu kugera ku miyoboro itoroshye kugerwaho n'ahantu h'Ibanze."

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "The following information has been determined from Cacti's configuration file. If it is not correct, please edit \"include/config.php\" before continuing."
msgstr "Amakuru akurikira yavanywe mu idosiye y'igenamiterere ya Cacti. Niba atari yo, nyamuneka hindura \"include/config.php\" mbere yo gukomeza."

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Local Database Connection Information"
msgstr "Amakuru yo Kwihuza n'Ububiko bw'Amakuru bw'Imbere"

#: lib/installer.php
#, php-format
msgid "Database: <b>%s</b>"
msgstr "Ububiko bw'amakuru: <b>%s</b>"

#: lib/installer.php
#, php-format
msgid "Database User: <b>%s</b>"
msgstr "Ukoresha ububiko bw'amakuru: <b>%s</b>"

#: lib/installer.php
#, php-format
msgid "Database Hostname: <b>%s</b>"
msgstr "Izina rya seriveri y'ububiko bw'amakuru: <b>%s</b>"

#: lib/installer.php
#, php-format
msgid "Port: <b>%s</b>"
msgstr "Umuyoboro (Port): <b>%s</b>"

#: lib/installer.php
#, php-format
msgid "Server Operating System Type: <b>%s</b>"
msgstr "Ubwoko bwa Sisitemu y'Imikorere ya Seriveri: <b>%s</b>"

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Central Database Connection Information"
msgstr "Amakuru yo Kwihuza n'Ububiko bw'Amakuru Bukuru"

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Configuration Readonly!"
msgstr "Igenamiterere Rishobora Gusomwa Gusa!"

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Your config.php file must be writable by the web server during install in order to configure the Remote poller.  Once installation is complete, you must set this file to Read Only to prevent possible security issues."
msgstr "Idosiye yawe ya config.php igomba kuba ishobora kwandikwamo na seriveri y'urubuga mu gihe cy'iyinjiza kugira ngo hagenwe imiterere ya Poller ya Kure. Iyinjiza nirirangira, ugomba gushyira iyi dosiye ku Gusoma Gusa kugira ngo wirinde ibibazo by'umutekano bishobora kubaho."

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Configuration of Poller"
msgstr "Igenamiterere rya Poller"

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Your Remote Cacti Poller information has not been included in your config.php file.  Please review the config.php.dist, and set the variables: <i>$rdatabase_default, $rdatabase_username</i>, etc.  These variables must be set and point back to your Primary Cacti database server.  Correct this and try again."
msgstr "Amakuru ya Poller yawe ya Cacti ya Kure ntiyashyizwe mu idosiye yawe ya config.php. Nyamuneka suzuma config.php.dist, kandi ugene ibipimo: <i>$rdatabase_default, $rdatabase_username</i>, n'ibindi. Ibi bipimo bigomba gushyirwaho kandi bikerekeza kuri seriveri y'ububiko bw'amakuru ya Cacti y'Ibanze. Kosora ibi maze wongere ugerageze."

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Remote Poller Variables"
msgstr "Ibipimo bya Poller ya Kure"

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "The variables that must be set in the config.php file include the following:"
msgstr "Ibipimo bigomba gushyirwa mu idosiye ya config.php birimo ibi bikurikira:"

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "The Installer automatically assigns a $poller_id and adds it to the config.php file."
msgstr "Porogaramu y'iyinjiza ihita itanga $poller_id kandi ikayongera mu idosiye ya config.php."

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Once the variables are all set in the config.php file, you must also grant the $rdatabase_username access to the main Cacti database server.  Follow the same procedure you would with any other Cacti install.  You may then press the 'Test Connection' button.  If the test is successful you will be able to proceed and complete the install."
msgstr "Iyo impinduragaciro zose zimaze gushyirwa mu idosiye ya config.php, ugomba kandi guha $rdatabase_username uburenganzira bwo kugera kuri seriveri nkuru y'ububiko bw'amakuru ya Cacti. Kurikiza uburyo bumwe n'ubwo wakoresha mu kindi gikorwa cyo gushyiramo Cacti. Ushobora rero gukanda buto ya 'Gerageza Ihuza'. Niba igerageza rigenze neza, uzashobora gukomeza no kurangiza igikorwa cyo gushyiramo."

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Additional Steps After Installation"
msgstr "Intambwe z'inyongera nyuma yo gushyiramo"

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "It is essential that the Central Cacti server can communicate via MySQL to each remote Cacti database server.  Once the install is complete, you must edit the Remote Data Collector and ensure the settings are correct.  You can verify using the 'Test Connection' when editing the Remote Data Collector."
msgstr "Ni ngombwa ko seriveri nkuru ya Cacti ishobora kuvugana binyuze muri MySQL na buri seriveri y'ububiko bw'amakuru ya Cacti ya kure. Iyo igikorwa cyo gushyiramo kirangiye, ugomba guhindura Ikusanyamakuru rya kure kandi ukagenzura ko igenamiterere ari ryo. Ushobora kubigenzura ukoresheje 'Gerageza Ihuza' igihe uhindura Ikusanyamakuru rya kure."

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Critical Binary Locations and Versions"
msgstr "Ahantu porogaramu z'ingenzi ziherereye na verisiyo zazo"

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Make sure all of these values are correct before continuing."
msgstr "Reba neza ko izi ndangagaciro zose ari zo mbere yo gukomeza."

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "One or more paths appear to be incorrect, unable to proceed"
msgstr "Inzira imwe cyangwa nyinshi zigaragara ko zitari zo, ntibishoboka gukomeza"

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Directory Permission Checks"
msgstr "Igenzura ry'uburenganzira bw'ububiko"

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Please ensure the directory permissions below are correct before proceeding.  During the install, these directories need to be owned by the Web Server user.  These permission changes are required to allow the Installer to install Device Template packages which include XML and script files that will be placed in these directories.  If you choose not to install the packages, there is an 'install_package.php' cli script that can be used from the command line after the install is complete."
msgstr "Nyamuneka reba neza ko uburenganzira bw'ububiko buri hasi ari bwo mbere yo gukomeza. Mu gihe cyo gushyiramo porogaramu, ubu bubiko bugomba kuba ari ubw'umukoresha wa Seriveri y'urubuga. Izi mpinduka z'uburenganzira zirakenewe kugira ngo porogaramu ishyiramo ishobore gushyiramo paki z'inyandikorugero z'ibikoresho zirimo amadosiye ya XML na script bizashyirwa muri ubu bubiko. Niba uhisemo kutashyiramo izo paki, hari script ya cli 'install_package.php' ishobora gukoreshwa ku murongo w'amabwiriza nyuma y'uko igikorwa cyo gushyiramo kirangiye."

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "After the install is complete, you can make some of these directories read only to increase security."
msgstr "Nyuma y'uko igikorwa cyo gushyiramo kirangiye, ushobora guhindura bumwe muri ubu bubiko bukaba ubwo gusoma gusa kugira ngo wongere umutekano."

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "These directories will be required to stay read writable after the install so that the Cacti remote synchronization process can update them as the Main Cacti Web Site changes"
msgstr "Ubu bubiko buzakomeza gusabwa kuba ubwo gusoma no kwandikwamo nyuma yo gushyiramo porogaramu kugira ngo igikorwa cyo guhuza cya kure cya Cacti gishobore kubuvugurura uko Urubuga rukuru rwa Cacti ruhinduka"

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "If you are installing packages, once the packages are installed, you should change the scripts directory back to read only as this presents some exposure to the web site."
msgstr "Niba uri gushyiramo paki, iyo zimaze gushyirwamo, ugomba gusubiza ububiko bwa scripts ku gusoma gusa kuko ibi bishobora gushyira urubuga mu kaga."

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "For remote pollers, it is critical that the paths that you will be updating frequently, including the plugins, scripts, and resources paths have read/write access as the data collector will have to update these paths from the main web server content."
msgstr "Ku ma poller ya kure, ni ngombwa cyane ko inzira uzajya uvugurura kenshi, harimo inzira za plugins, scripts, na resources ziba zifite uburenganzira bwo gusoma/kwandika kuko ikusanyamakuru rizajya rigomba kuvugurura izo nzira rivanye mu birimo biri kuri seriveri nkuru y'urubuga."

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Required Writable at Install Time Only"
msgstr "Bisabwa Kwandikwamo mu Gihe cyo Gushyiramo Gusa"

#: lib/installer.php package_import.php
msgid "Not Writable"
msgstr "Ntibwandikwamo"

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Required Writable after Install Complete"
msgstr "Bisabwa Kwandikwamo Nyuma yo Kurangiza Gushyiramo"

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Potential permission issues"
msgstr "Ibibazo by'uburenganzira bishoboka"

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Please make sure that your webserver has read/write access to the cacti folders that show errors below."
msgstr "Nyamuneka reba neza ko seriveri yawe y'urubuga ifite uburenganzira bwo gusoma/kwandika mu bubiko bwa cacti bugaragaza amakosa hasi aha."

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "If SELinux is enabled on your server, you can either permanently disable this, or temporarily disable it and then add the appropriate permissions using the SELinux command-line tools."
msgstr "Niba SELinux ikora kuri seriveri yawe, ushobora kuyihagarika burundu, cyangwa ukayihagarika by'agateganyo hanyuma ukongeraho uburenganzira bukwiye ukoresheje ibikoresho by'umurongo w'amabwiriza bya SELinux."

#: lib/installer.php
#, php-format
msgid "The user '%s' should have MODIFY permission to enable read/write."
msgstr "Umukoresha '%s' agomba kuba afite uburenganzira bwa MODIFY kugira ngo ashobore gusoma/kwandika."

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "An example of how to set folder permissions is shown here, though you may need to adjust this depending on your operating system, user accounts and desired permissions."
msgstr "Urugero rw'uko washyiraho uburenganzira bw'ububiko rwerekanwe hano, nubwo bishobora kuba ngombwa ko ubihindura bitewe na sisitemu ikoreshwa, konti z'abakoresha n'uburenganzira wifuza."

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "EXAMPLE:"
msgstr "URUGERO:"

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Once installation has completed the CSRF path, should be set to read-only."
msgstr "Iyo igikorwa cyo gushyiramo kirangiye, inzira ya CSRF igomba gushyirwa ku gusoma gusa."

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "All folders are writable"
msgstr "Ububiko bwose burandikwamo"

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Input Validation Whitelist Protection"
msgstr "Uburinzi bw'Urutonde rwemewe rwo Kugenzura Ibyinjizwa"

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Cacti Data Input methods that call a script can be exploited in ways that a non-administrator can perform damage to either files owned by the poller account, and in cases where someone runs the Cacti poller as root, can compromise the operating system allowing attackers to exploit your infrastructure."
msgstr "Uburyo bwo Kwinjiza Amakuru bwa Cacti buhamagara script bushobora gukoreshwa nabi mu buryo butuma utari umuyobozi ashobora kwangiza amadosiye ya konti ya poller, kandi mu gihe umuntu akoresha poller ya Cacti nka root, bishobora guhungabanya sisitemu ikoreshwa bigaha abagizi ba nabi uburyo bwo gufata ibikorwaremezo byawe."

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Therefore, several versions ago, Cacti was enhanced to provide Whitelist capabilities on the these types of Data Input Methods.  Though this does secure Cacti more thoroughly, it does increase the amount of work required by the Cacti administrator to import and manage Templates and Packages."
msgstr "Ku bw'ibyo, guhera kuri verisiyo nyinshi zishize, Cacti yavuguruwe kugira ngo itange ubushobozi bw'Urutonde rwemewe kuri ubu bwoko bw'Uburyo bwo Kwinjiza Amakuru. Nubwo ibi birinda Cacti mu buryo bwimbitse kurushaho, byongera akazi gasabwa umuyobozi wa Cacti mu kuzana no gucunga Inyandikorugero na Paki."

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "The way that the Whitelisting works is that when you first import a Data Input Method, or you re-import a Data Input Method, and the script and or arguments change in any way, the Data Input Method, and all the corresponding Data Sources will be immediately disabled until the administrator validates that the Data Input Method is valid."
msgstr "Uburyo Urutonde rwemewe rukoramo ni uko iyo uzanye bwa mbere Uburyo bwo Kwinjiza Amakuru, cyangwa iyo wongeye kuzana Uburyo bwo Kwinjiza Amakuru, maze script na/cyangwa ibipimo byayo bigahinduka mu buryo ubwo ari bwo bwose, Uburyo bwo Kwinjiza Amakuru, n'Inkomoko z'Amakuru zose zijyanye na bwo bihita bihagarikwa ako kanya kugeza igihe umuyobozi yemeje ko ubwo Buryo bwo Kwinjiza Amakuru bwemewe."

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "To make identifying Data Input Methods in this state, we have provided a validation script in Cacti's CLI directory that can be run with the following options:"
msgstr "Kugira ngo byorohe kumenya Uburyo bwo Kwinjiza Amakuru buri muri iki cyiciro, twatanze script yo kugenzura mu bubiko bwa CLI bwa Cacti ishobora gukoreshwa hamwe n'amahitamo akurikira:"

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "This script option will search for any Data Input Methods that are currently banned and provide details as to why."
msgstr "Iri hitamo rya script rizashakisha Uburyo bwo Kwinjiza Amakuru bwose buhagaritswe ubu kandi ritange ibisobanuro ku mpamvu yabiteye."

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "This script option un-ban the Data Input Methods that are currently banned."
msgstr "Iri hitamo rya script rikuraho ihagarikwa ry'Uburyo bwo Kwinjiza Amakuru bwose buhagaritswe ubu."

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "This script option will re-enable any disabled Data Sources."
msgstr "Iri hitamo rya script rizongera gukoresha Inkomoko z'Amakuru zose zahagaritswe."

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "It is strongly suggested that you update your config.php to enable this feature by uncommenting the <b>$input_whitelist</b> variable and then running the three CLI script options above after the web based install has completed."
msgstr "Birasabwa cyane ko uvugurura dosiye yawe ya config.php kugira ngo ufungure iki gikorwa ukura ikimenyetso cy'ibisobanuro ku gihindurwa cya <b>$input_whitelist</b> hanyuma ugakoresha amahitamo atatu ya sikiripiti ya CLI ari haruguru nyuma y'uko iyinjiza ryo ku rubuga rirangiye."

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Check the Checkbox below to acknowledge that you have read and understand this security concern"
msgstr "Hitamo agasanduku kari hasi kugira ngo wemeze ko wasomye kandi wumvise iki kibazo kijyanye n'umutekano"

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "I have read this statement"
msgstr "Nasomye iri tangazo"

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Default Profile"
msgstr "Umwirondoro w'Ibanze"

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Please select the default Data Source Profile to be used for polling sources.  This is the maximum amount of time between scanning devices for information so the lower the polling interval, the more work is placed on the Cacti Server host.  Also, select the intended, or configured Cron interval that you wish to use for Data Collection."
msgstr "Nyamuneka hitamo Umwirondoro w'isoko y'amakuru usanzwe uzajya ukoreshwa mu gukusanya amakuru ku masoko. Iki ni cyo gihe ntarengwa kiri hagati yo gusuzuma ibikoresho hagamijwe kubona amakuru, bityo uko igihe cyo gukusanya amakuru kiba kigufi ni ko umutwaro w'akazi uba mwinshi kuri seriveri ya Cacti. Kandi hitamo igihe cya Cron cyagenwe cyangwa cyateguwe wifuza gukoresha mu gukusanya amakuru."

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Cron Interval"
msgstr "Intera ya Cron"

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Default Automation Network"
msgstr "Umuyoboro w'Ibanze w'Ikwikora"

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Cacti can automatically scan the network once installation has completed. This will utilise the network range below to work out the range of IPs that can be scanned.  A predefined set of options are defined for scanning which include using both 'public' and 'private' communities."
msgstr "Cacti ishobora gusikana umuyoboro mu buryo bwikora iyo iyinjizaporogaramu rirangiye. Ibi bizakoresha urwego rw'umuyoboro ruri hasi kugira ngo bibare urwego rwa za IP zishobora gusikanwa. Amahitamo yateguwe mbere yo gusikana arimo gukoresha amatsinda ya 'public' na 'private'."

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "If your devices require a different set of options to be used first, you may define them below and they will be utilized before the defaults"
msgstr "Niba ibikoresho byawe bisaba ubundi buryo bw'amahitamo bukoreshwa mbere, ushobora kubushyiraho hasi kandi buzakoreshwa mbere y'amahitamo y'ibanze"

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "All options may be adjusted post installation"
msgstr "Amahitamo yose ashobora guhindurwa nyuma yo gushyiramo porogaramu"

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Default Options"
msgstr "Amahitamo y'Ibanze"

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Scan Mode"
msgstr "Uburyo bwo Gusikana"

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Network Range"
msgstr "Urwego rw'Umuyoboro"

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Additional Defaults"
msgstr "Andi Mahitamo y'Ibanze"

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Additional SNMP Options"
msgstr "Andi Mahitamo ya SNMP"

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Error Locating Profiles"
msgstr "Ikosa mu Gushaka Imyirondoro"

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "The installation cannot continue because no profiles could be found."
msgstr "Iyinjizaporogaramu ntirishobora gukomeza kuko nta myirondoro yabashije kuboneka."

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "This may occur if you have a blank database and have not yet imported the cacti.sql file"
msgstr "Ibi bishobora kubaho niba ufite ububiko bw'amakuru budafite icyo burimo kandi ukaba utarinjiza dosiye ya cacti.sql"

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Template Setup"
msgstr "Itunganya ry'Inyandikorugero"

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Please select the Device Templates that you wish to update during the Upgrade."
