#: lib/utility.php
msgid "Maximum size to which user-created MEMORY tables may grow."
msgstr "Ingano ntarengwa imbonerahamwe za MEMORY zakozwe n'umukoresha zishobora gukura zikageraho."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "Bytes; sized relative to total system memory."
msgstr "Bayite; igenwa hashingiwe ku bubiko rusange bwa sisitemu."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "Maximum size of internal in-memory temporary tables before they spill to disk."
msgstr "Ingano ntarengwa y'imbonerahamwe z'igihe gito z'imbere mu bubiko mbere y'uko zimurirwa kuri disiki."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "Bytes; a larger value keeps temporary tables in memory."
msgstr "Bayite; agaciro kanini kagumisha imbonerahamwe z'igihe gito mu bubiko."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "Minimum per-join buffer size for joins that do not use indexes."
msgstr "Ingano nto y'ububiko bw'agateganyo kuri buri ihuza ridakoresha indeksi."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "Bytes; per-connection allocation, default 262144."
msgstr "Bayite; itangwa kuri buri kwihuza, mburabuzi ni 262144."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "Per-session buffer allocated for sorts (ORDER BY / GROUP BY)."
msgstr "Ububiko bw'agateganyo kuri buri mukoro bugenerwa itondeka (ORDER BY / GROUP BY)."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "Bytes; per-connection allocation, default 2097152."
msgstr "Bayite; itangwa kuri buri kwihuza, mburabuzi ni 2097152."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "Store each InnoDB table and its indexes in its own .ibd tablespace file."
msgstr "Bika buri mbonerahamwe ya InnoDB n'indeksi zayo mu idosiye yayo yihariye y'ububiko bwa .ibd."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "ON or OFF; ON is recommended."
msgstr "ON cyangwa OFF; ON ni yo igirwa inama."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "InnoDB on-disk file format (Antelope or Barracuda); Barracuda is now the only format."
msgstr "Imiterere y'idosiye ya InnoDB kuri disiki (Antelope cyangwa Barracuda); ubu Barracuda ni yo miterere yonyine."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "Antelope, Barracuda."
msgstr "Antelope, Barracuda."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "Allow index key prefixes longer than 767 bytes (requires the Barracuda format)."
msgstr "Emerera imbanziriza z'urufunguzo rwa indeksi zirengeje bayite 767 (bisaba imiterere ya Barracuda)."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "ON/1 or OFF/0; this behaviour is now always enabled."
msgstr "ON/1 cyangwa OFF/0; iyi mikorere ubu ihora ifunguye."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "Total memory InnoDB uses to cache table and index data."
msgstr "Ububiko bwose InnoDB ikoresha mu kubika by'agateganyo amakuru y'imbonerahamwe na indeksi."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "Bytes; commonly 25%-80% of total system memory."
msgstr "Bayite; akenshi iba 25%-80% y'ububiko bwose bwa sisitemu."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "Write pages twice (the doublewrite buffer) to protect against partial page writes."
msgstr "Andika impapuro kabiri (ububiko bwa doublewrite) kugira ngo urinde kwandika urupapuro igice."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "ON or OFF."
msgstr "ON cyangwa OFF."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "Legacy pool for the InnoDB internal data dictionary and structures."
msgstr "Ububiko rusange bwa kera bw'inkoranyamagambo y'amakuru n'imiterere y'imbere ya InnoDB."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "Bytes; obsolete on modern servers."
msgstr "Bayite; ntibigikoreshwa kuri seriveri zigezweho."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "Seconds an InnoDB transaction waits for a row lock before giving up."
msgstr "Amasegonda igikorwa cya InnoDB gitegereza ifungwa ry'umurongo mbere yo guhagarara."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "Seconds; default 50."
msgstr "Amasegonda; mburabuzi ni 50."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "Method used to flush data and log files to disk."
msgstr "Uburyo bukoreshwa mu kohereza amakuru n'amadosiye y'ibyakozwe kuri disiki."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "O_DIRECT, fsync, O_DSYNC, and similar."
msgstr "O_DIRECT, fsync, O_DSYNC, n'ibindi bisa nabyo."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "Controls how the redo log is written and flushed at transaction commit."
msgstr "Igenzura uburyo inyandiko y'isubiramo yandikwa ikanoherezwa kuri disiki iyo igikorwa cyemejwe."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "0, 1, or 2."
msgstr "0, 1, cyangwa 2."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "Legacy single setting for InnoDB file I/O threads, replaced by the read/write I/O thread settings."
msgstr "Igenamiterere rimwe rya kera ry'imiyoboro ya I/O y'amadosiye ya InnoDB, ryasimbujwe igenamiterere ry'imiyoboro ya I/O yo gusoma no kwandika."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "Integer; superseded by innodb_read_io_threads and innodb_write_io_threads."
msgstr "Umubare wuzuye; wasimbujwe innodb_read_io_threads na innodb_write_io_threads."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "Write and flush the InnoDB redo log every N seconds."
msgstr "Andika kandi wohereze kuri disiki inyandiko y'isubiramo ya InnoDB buri masegonda N."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "Seconds (1-2700); default 1."
msgstr "Amasegonda (1-2700); mburabuzi ni 1."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "Number of I/O threads used for read operations in InnoDB."
msgstr "Umubare w'imiyoboro ya I/O ikoreshwa mu bikorwa byo gusoma muri InnoDB."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "1-64; default 4."
msgstr "1-64; mburabuzi ni 4."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "Number of I/O threads used for write operations in InnoDB."
msgstr "Umubare w'imiyoboro ya I/O ikoreshwa mu bikorwa byo kwandika muri InnoDB."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "Number of regions the InnoDB buffer pool is divided into."
msgstr "Umubare w'ibice ububiko rusange bw'agateganyo bwa InnoDB bugabanyijwemo."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "1-64; MariaDB removed this in 10.6."
msgstr "1-64; MariaDB yabikuyemo muri 10.6."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "Estimated I/O operations per second available to InnoDB background tasks."
msgstr "Igereranya ry'ibikorwa bya I/O ku isegonda bihari ku mirimo ya InnoDB ikorwa inyuma."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "Integer; use higher values for SSD/NVMe storage."
msgstr "Umubare wuzuye; koresha agaciro kanini ku bubiko bwa SSD/NVMe."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "Maximum IOPS InnoDB may use when flushing falls behind."
msgstr "IOPS ntarengwa InnoDB ishobora gukoresha iyo kohereza kuri disiki kwasigaye inyuma."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "Flush neighbouring dirty pages in the same extent when flushing a page."
msgstr "Ohereza kuri disiki impapuro zegeranye zahinduwe ziri mu gice kimwe iyo wohereza urupapuro."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "0, 1, or 2; use 0 on SSD storage."
msgstr "0, 1, cyangwa 2; koresha 0 ku bubiko bwa SSD."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "Use hardware atomic writes (MariaDB) so the doublewrite buffer can be safely disabled."
msgstr "Koresha ukwandika kudacikagurika kw'ibikoresho (MariaDB) kugira ngo ububiko bwa doublewrite bushobore guhagarikwa mu mutekano."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "ON or OFF; MariaDB only."
msgstr "ON cyangwa OFF; MariaDB gusa."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "Enforce strict snapshot isolation for InnoDB transactions."
msgstr "Genzura itandukanya rikomeye ry'amafoto y'amakuru ku bikorwa bya InnoDB."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "ON or OFF; back-ported to MariaDB 10.6.18+, 10.11.8+ and 11.4.2+. Set OFF for the Cacti poller."
msgstr "ON cyangwa OFF; byashyizwe inyuma muri MariaDB 10.6.18+, 10.11.8+ na 11.4.2+. Shiraho OFF ku gikusanyamakuru cya Cacti."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "Removed"
msgstr "Byakuweho"

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "Deprecated"
msgstr "Ntibikigezweho"

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "Not applicable to this engine"
msgstr "Ntibikoreshwa kuri iyi moteri"

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "Supported"
msgstr "Birashyigikiwe"

#: lib/utility.php
#, php-format
msgid "%s Variable Capability Matrix"
msgstr "Imbonerahamwe y'ubushobozi bw'impinduragaciro ya %s"

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "Support by engine and version for each Cacti-recommended variable"
msgstr "Ubushobozi hakurikijwe moteri na verisiyo kuri buri mpinduragaciro isabwa na Cacti"

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "Variable"
msgstr "Impinduragaciro"

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "Available settings:"
msgstr "Igenamiterere rihari:"

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "N/A - Not applicable to this engine"
msgstr "N/A - Ntibikoreshwa kuri iyi moteri"

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "MariaDB 10.5+ and MySQL 8.0+ are the recommended, supported releases (for example, the default database streams on Rocky Linux 9). Make sure you run the very latest release though which fixes a long standing low level networking issue that was causing spine many issues with reliability."
msgstr "MariaDB 10.5+ na MySQL 8.0+ ni zo verisiyo zishishikarizwa kandi zishyigikiwe (urugero, imiyoboro isanzwe y'ububiko bw'amakuru kuri Rocky Linux 9). Ariko menya neza ko ukoresha verisiyo iheruka cyane ikemura ikibazo cyo ku rwego rwo hasi mu miyoboro cyamaze igihe kirekire cyateraga spine ibibazo byinshi by'imikorere yizewe."

#: lib/utility.php
#, php-format
msgid "It is STRONGLY recommended that you enable InnoDB in any %s version greater than 5.5.3."
msgstr "Birasabwa CYANE ko ufungura InnoDB muri verisiyo iyo ari yo yose ya %s irenze 5.5.3."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "When using Cacti with languages other than English, it is important to use the utf8mb4_unicode_ci collation type as some characters take more than a single byte."
msgstr "Iyo ukoresha Cacti mu zindi ndimi zitari Icyongereza, ni ngombwa gukoresha ubwoko bw'itondeka bwa utf8mb4_unicode_ci kuko inyuguti zimwe zifata bayite zirenze imwe."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "When using Cacti with languages other than English, it is important to use the utf8mb4 character set as some characters take more than a single byte."
msgstr "Iyo ukoresha Cacti mu zindi ndimi zitari Icyongereza, ni ngombwa gukoresha itsinda ry'inyuguti rya utf8mb4 kuko inyuguti zimwe zifata bayite zirenze imwe."

#: lib/utility.php
#, php-format
msgid "It is recommended that you enable InnoDB in any %s version greater than 5.1."
msgstr "Birasabwa ko ufungura InnoDB muri verisiyo iyo ari yo yose ya %s irenze 5.1."

#: lib/utility.php
#, php-format
msgid "Depending on the number of logins and use of spine data collector, %s will need many connections.  The calculation for spine is: total_connections = total_processes * (total_threads + script_servers + 1), then you must leave headroom for user connections, which will change depending on the number of concurrent login accounts."
msgstr "Ukurikije umubare w'abinjira n'ikoreshwa ry'igikusanyamakuru cya spine, %s izakenera ihuza ryinshi. Ibarura kuri spine ni: total_connections = total_processes * (total_threads + script_servers + 1), hanyuma ugomba gusiga umwanya w'inyongera w'ukwihuza kw'abakoresha, uzahinduka bitewe n'umubare wa konti zinjira icyarimwe."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "Keeping the table cache larger means less file open/close operations when using innodb_file_per_table."
msgstr "Kugumisha ububiko bw'imbonerahamwe ari bunini bisobanura ibikorwa bike byo gufungura/gufunga amadosiye igihe ukoresha innodb_file_per_table."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "With Remote polling capabilities, large amounts of data will be synced from the main server to the remote pollers.  Therefore, keep this value at or above 16M."
msgstr "Hamwe n'ubushobozi bwo gukusanya amakuru uri kure, amakuru menshi azahuzwa avuye kuri seriveri nkuru ajya ku bikusanyamakuru bya kure. Ku bw'ibyo, gumisha aka gaciro kuri 16M cyangwa hejuru yayo."

#: lib/utility.php
#, php-format
msgid "If using the Cacti Performance Booster and choosing a memory storage engine, you have to be careful to flush your Performance Booster buffer before the system runs out of memory table space.  This is done two ways, first reducing the size of your output column to just the right size.  This column is in the tables poller_output, and poller_output_boost.  The second thing you can do is allocate more memory to memory tables.  We have arbitrarily chosen a recommended value of 10%% of system memory, but if you are using SSD disk drives, or have a smaller system, you may ignore this recommendation or choose a different storage engine.  You may see the expected consumption of the Performance Booster tables under Console -> System Utilities -> View Boost Status."
msgstr "Niba ukoresha Cacti Performance Booster kandi ugahitamo moteri yo kubika mu bubiko bw'igihe gito (memory), ugomba kwitonda ugasukura ububiko bw'agateganyo bwa Performance Booster mbere y'uko sisitemu ishira umwanya w'imbonerahamwe za memuwari. Ibi bikorwa mu buryo bubiri: ubwa mbere ni ukugabanya ingano y'inkingi isohoka ikagera ku ngano ikwiye neza. Iyi nkingi iboneka mu mbonerahamwe poller_output na poller_output_boost. Icya kabiri wakora ni ukugenera ububiko bwinshi bw'igihe gito ku mbonerahamwe za memuwari. Twahisemo ku buryo bw'ikigereranyo agaciro gasabwa ka 10%% by'ububiko bw'igihe gito bwa sisitemu, ariko niba ukoresha disiki za SSD, cyangwa ufite sisitemu ntoya, ushobora kwirengagiza iki cyifuzo cyangwa ugahitamo indi moteri ibika amakuru. Ushobora kureba umwanya uteganyijwe gukoreshwa n'imbonerahamwe za Performance Booster munsi ya Console -> System Utilities -> View Boost Status."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "When executing subqueries, having a larger temporary table size, keep those temporary tables in memory."
msgstr "Igihe ukora ibisabwa byungirije (subqueries), kugira ingano nini y'imbonerahamwe z'agateganyo bituma izo mbonerahamwe z'agateganyo ziguma mu bubiko bw'igihe gito (memory)."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "When performing joins, if they are below this size, they will be kept in memory and never written to a temporary file.  As this is a per connection memory allocation, care must be taken not to increase it too high.  The sum of the join_buffer_size + sort_buffer_size + read_buffer_size + read_rnd_buffer_size + thread_stack + binlog_cache_size + Core MySQL/MariaDB memory should be below 80%.  If the recommendation is negative, you must decrease this and or the sort_buffer_size until the recommendation fits within the allowable memory."
msgstr "Mu gihe hakorwa ihuza ry'imbonerahamwe, niba riri munsi y'iki gipimo, rizagumishwa mu bubiko bw'akanya gato kandi ntirizigera ryandikwa muri dosiye y'akanya gato.  Kubera ko uku ari ugutanga ububiko ku mugenzo umwe, hagomba kwitonderwa kutabwongera cyane.  Igiteranyo cya join_buffer_size + sort_buffer_size + read_buffer_size + read_rnd_buffer_size + thread_stack + binlog_cache_size + ububiko bw'ibanze bwa MySQL/MariaDB kigomba kuba munsi ya 80%.  Niba icyifuzo kiri munsi ya zeru, ugomba kugabanya iki cyangwa sort_buffer_size kugeza igihe icyifuzo kijyanye n'ububiko bwemewe."

#: lib/utility.php
#, php-format
msgid "When using InnoDB storage it is important to keep your table spaces separate.  This makes managing the tables simpler for long time users of %s.  If you are running with this currently off, you can migrate to the per file storage by enabling the feature, and then running an alter statement on all InnoDB tables."
msgstr "Igihe ukoresha ububiko bwa InnoDB ni ngombwa gutandukanya imyanya y'imbonerahamwe zawe. Ibi byoroshya gucunga imbonerahamwe ku bakoresha ba kera ba %s. Niba ubu ukora ibi bifunze, ushobora kwimukira ku bubiko bwa buri dosiye ufungura iki gikorwa, hanyuma ugakora itegeko rya alter ku mbonerahamwe zose za InnoDB."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "When using innodb_file_per_table, it is important to set the innodb_file_format to Barracuda.  This setting will allow longer indexes important for certain Cacti tables."
msgstr "Igihe ukoresha innodb_file_per_table, ni ngombwa gushyira innodb_file_format kuri Barracuda. Iri genamiterere rizemerera imigereka y'ishakisha (indexes) miremire y'ingenzi ku mbonerahamwe zimwe na zimwe za Cacti."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "If your tables have very large indexes, you must operate with the Barracuda innodb_file_format and the innodb_large_prefix equal to 1.  Failure to do this may result in plugins that can not properly create tables."
msgstr "Niba imbonerahamwe zawe zifite imigereka y'ishakisha (indexes) minini cyane, ugomba gukoresha innodb_file_format ya Barracuda na innodb_large_prefix bingana na 1. Kutabikora bishobora gutuma imigereka y'inyongera (plugins) idashobora gukora imbonerahamwe neza."

#: lib/utility.php
#, php-format
msgid "InnoDB will hold as much tables and indexes in system memory as is possible.  Therefore, you should make the innodb_buffer_pool large enough to hold as much of the tables and index in memory.  Checking the size of the /var/lib/mysql/cacti directory will help in determining this value.  We are recommending 25%% of your systems total memory, but your requirements will vary depending on your systems size."
msgstr "InnoDB izabika imbonerahamwe n'urutonde rw'ishakisha mu bubiko bw'akanya gato bwa sisitemu uko bishoboka kose.  Kubera iyo mpamvu, ugomba kugira innodb_buffer_pool nini bihagije kugira ngo ibike imbonerahamwe n'urutonde rw'ishakisha byinshi mu bubiko bw'akanya gato.  Kugenzura ingano y'ububiko bwa /var/lib/mysql/cacti bizafasha mu kumenya iki gipimo.  Turagira inama ya 25%% by'ububiko bwose bwa sisitemu yawe, ariko ibyo ukeneye bizatandukana bitewe n'ingano ya sisitemu yawe."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "This settings should remain ON unless your Cacti instances is running on either ZFS or FusionI/O which both have internal journaling to accommodate abrupt system crashes.  However, if you have very good power, and your systems rarely go down and you have backups, turning this setting to OFF can net you almost a 50% increase in database performance."
msgstr "Iyi genamiterere igomba kuguma kuri ON keretse niba Cacti yawe ikorera kuri ZFS cyangwa FusionI/O zombi zifite uburyo bw'imbere bwo kwandika ibikorwa kugira ngo bihanganire ihagarara ritunguranye rya sisitemu.  Nyamara, niba ufite umuriro w'amashanyarazi mwiza cyane, kandi sisitemu zawe zidakunze guhagarara ndetse ukaba ufite kopi z'ububiko, gushyira iyi genamiterere kuri OFF bishobora kuguha hafi inyongera ya 50% mu mikorere y'ububiko bw'amakuru."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "This is where metadata is stored. If you had a lot of tables, it would be useful to increase this."
msgstr "Aha ni ho habikwa amakuru asobanura ayandi (metadata). Niba ufite imbonerahamwe nyinshi, byaba byiza kongera iki gipimo."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "Rogue queries should not for the database to go offline to others.  Kill these queries before they kill your system."
msgstr "Ibibazo by'ububikoshingiro bikora nabi ntibikwiye gutuma ububikoshingiro buhagarara ku bandi. Hagarika ibyo bibazo mbere y'uko bihagarika sisitemu yawe."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "Maximum I/O performance happens when you use the O_DIRECT method to flush pages."
msgstr "Imikorere yo ku rwego rwo hejuru ya I/O iboneka iyo ukoresheje uburyo bwa O_DIRECT mu gusohora amapaji."

#: lib/utility.php
#, php-format
msgid "Setting this value to 2 means that you will flush all transactions every second rather than at commit.  This allows %s to perform writing less often."
msgstr "Gushyira iki gipimo kuri 2 bisobanura ko uzajya usohora ibikorwa byose buri segonda aho kubisohora igihe byemejwe. Ibi bituma %s yandika gake gake."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "With modern SSD type storage, having multiple io threads is advantageous for applications with high io characteristics."
msgstr "Ku bubiko bwa SSD bugezweho, kugira imiyoboro myinshi ya io ni ingirakamaro ku porogaramu zikenera cyane ibikorwa bya io."

#: lib/utility.php
#, php-format
msgid "As of %s %s, the you can control how often %s flushes transactions to disk.  The default is 1 second, but in high I/O systems setting to a value greater than 1 can allow disk I/O to be more sequential"
msgstr "Kuva kuri %1$s %2$s, ushobora kugenzura inshuro %3$s isohora ibikorwa ku bubiko (disk). Igipimo mbanziriza ni isegonda 1, ariko muri sisitemu zikoresha I/O nyinshi gushyiraho igipimo kirenze 1 bishobora gutuma I/O ku bubiko ikorwa ku murongo ugororotse kurushaho"

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "With modern SSD type storage, having multiple read io threads is advantageous for applications with high io characteristics.  Depending on your MariaDB/MySQL versions, this value can go as high as 64.  But try to keep the number less than your total SMT threads on the database server."
msgstr "Ku bubiko bwa SSD bugezweho, kugira imiyoboro myinshi yo gusoma (read io) ni ingirakamaro ku porogaramu zikenera cyane ibikorwa bya io. Bitewe na verisiyo zawe za MariaDB/MySQL, iki gipimo gishobora kugera kuri 64. Ariko gerageza gutuma uyu mubare uba muto ugereranyije n'imiyoboro yose ya SMT iri kuri seriveri y'ububikoshingiro."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "With modern SSD type storage, having multiple write io threads is advantageous for applications with high io characteristics.  Depending on your MariaDB/MySQL versions, this value can go as high as 64.  But try to keep the number less than your total SMT threads on the database server."
msgstr "Ku bubiko bwa SSD bugezweho, kugira imiyoboro myinshi yo kwandika (write io) ni ingirakamaro ku porogaramu zikenera cyane ibikorwa bya io. Bitewe na verisiyo zawe za MariaDB/MySQL, iki gipimo gishobora kugera kuri 64. Ariko gerageza gutuma uyu mubare uba muto ugereranyije n'imiyoboro yose ya SMT iri kuri seriveri y'ububikoshingiro."

#: lib/utility.php
#, php-format
msgid "%s will divide the innodb_buffer_pool into memory regions to improve performance for versions of MariaDB less than 10.5.  The max value is 64, but should not exceed more than the number of CPU cores/threads.  When your innodb_buffer_pool is less than 1GB, you should use the pool size divided by 128MB.  Continue to use this equation up to the max the number of CPU cores or 64."
msgstr "%s izagabanyamo innodb_buffer_pool mo uduce tw'ububiko bw'agateganyo (memory regions) kugira ngo inoze imikorere kuri verisiyo za MariaDB ziri munsi ya 10.5. Igipimo ntarengwa ni 64, ariko ntikigomba kurenga umubare wa za cores/imiyoboro ya CPU. Iyo innodb_buffer_pool yawe iri munsi ya 1GB, ukwiye gukoresha ingano yayo ugabanyijeho 128MB. Komeza ukoreshe iri hame kugeza ku mubare ntarengwa wa za cores za CPU cyangwa 64."

#: lib/utility.php
#, php-format
msgid "%s will divide the innodb_buffer_pool into memory regions to improve performance for versions of MySQL upto and including MySQL 8.0.  The max value is 64, but should not exceed more than the number of CPU cores/threads.  When your innodb_buffer_pool is less than 1GB, you should use the pool size divided by 128MB.  Continue to use this equation up to the max of the number of CPU cores or 64."
msgstr "%s izagabanyamo innodb_buffer_pool mo uduce tw'ububiko bw'agateganyo (memory regions) kugira ngo inoze imikorere kuri verisiyo za MySQL kugeza kuri MySQL 8.0 no kuyirimo. Igipimo ntarengwa ni 64, ariko ntikigomba kurenga umubare wa za cores/imiyoboro ya CPU. Iyo innodb_buffer_pool yawe iri munsi ya 1GB, ukwiye gukoresha ingano yayo ugabanyijeho 128MB. Komeza ukoreshe iri hame kugeza ku mubare ntarengwa wa za cores za CPU cyangwa 64."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "If you have SSD disks, use this suggestion.  If you have physical hard drives, use 200 * the number of active drives in the array.  If using NVMe or PCIe Flash, much larger numbers as high as 100000 can be used."
msgstr "Niba ufite ububiko bwa SSD, koresha iki cyifuzo. Niba ufite ububiko busanzwe (physical hard drives), koresha 200 * umubare w'ububiko bukora mu itsinda ryabwo (array). Niba ukoresha NVMe cyangwa PCIe Flash, imibare minini cyane ishobora kugera kuri 100000 irashoboka."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "If you have SSD disks, use this suggestion.  If you have physical hard drives, use 2000 * the number of active drives in the array.  If using NVMe or PCIe Flash, much larger numbers as high as 200000 can be used."
msgstr "Niba ufite ububiko bwa SSD, koresha iki cyifuzo. Niba ufite ububiko busanzwe (physical hard drives), koresha 2000 * umubare w'ububiko bukora mu itsinda ryabwo (array). Niba ukoresha NVMe cyangwa PCIe Flash, imibare minini cyane ishobora kugera kuri 200000 irashoboka."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "If you have SSD disks, set this to 0. Otherwise, do not set this setting."
msgstr "Niba ufite ububiko bwa SSD, shyira iki kuri 0. Bitabaye ibyo, ntushyireho iri genamiterere."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "With modern SSD type storage, having multiple read io threads is advantageous for applications with high io characteristics."
msgstr "Ku bubiko bwa SSD bugezweho, kugira imiyoboro myinshi yo gusoma (read io) ni ingirakamaro ku porogaramu zikenera cyane ibikorwa bya io."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "With modern SSD type storage, having multiple write io threads is advantageous for applications with high io characteristics."
msgstr "Ku bubiko bwa SSD bugezweho, kugira imiyoboro myinshi yo kwandika (write io) ni ingirakamaro ku porogaramu zikenera cyane ibikorwa bya io."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "When using MariaDB 10.2.4 and above, this setting should be off if atomic writes are enabled.  Therefore, please enable atomic writes instead of the double write buffer as it will increase performance."
msgstr "Iyo ukoresha MariaDB 10.2.4 no hejuru yayo, iri genamiterere rikwiye kuba rizimye (off) niba atomic writes zikora. Kubw'ibyo, nyamuneka fungura atomic writes aho gukoresha double write buffer kuko bizongera imikorere."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "When using MariaDB 10.2.4 and above, you can use atomic writes over the doublewrite buffer to increase performance."
msgstr "Iyo ukoresha MariaDB 10.2.4 no hejuru yayo, ushobora gukoresha atomic writes aho gukoresha doublewrite buffer kugira ngo wongere imikorere."

