#: user_domains.php
msgid "Mode which cacti will attempt to authenticate against the LDAP server.<blockquote><i>No Searching</i> - No Distinguished Name (DN) searching occurs, just attempt to bind with the provided Distinguished Name (DN) format.<br><br><i>Anonymous Searching</i> - Attempts to search for username against LDAP directory via anonymous binding to locate the users Distinguished Name (DN).<br><br><i>Specific Searching</i> - Attempts search for username against LDAP directory via Specific Distinguished Name (DN) and Specific Password for binding to locate the users Distinguished Name (DN).<br><br><i>One-Time Passwords (OTP/MFA)</i> - Cacti binds the user's password only once, during final authentication.  <i>No Searching</i> performs no directory lookup and binds directly using the Distinguished Name (DN) template, so it is safe for OTP when the DN template alone identifies the user.  When a directory lookup is required to resolve the DN, use <i>Specific Searching</i> with a dedicated service account (or <i>Anonymous Searching</i> where the directory permits it) so the lookup never consumes the user's single-use code.  For resilient OTP deployments use a single DNS load balancer name in the Server(s) field rather than a space delimited multi-server list, which would re-attempt the bind with an already-consumed one-time password."
msgstr "Uburyo Cacti izagerageza kwemeza umwirondoro kuri seriveri ya LDAP.<blockquote><i>Nta gushakisha</i> - Nta gushakisha Izina Riranga (DN) bibaho, igerageza gusa guhuza ikoresheje imiterere y'Izina Riranga (DN) yatanzwe.<br><br><i>Gushakisha bitazwi</i> - Igerageza gushakisha izina ry'ukoresha mu bubiko bwa LDAP ikoresheje guhuza kutazwi kugira ngo ibone Izina Riranga (DN) ry'ukoresha.<br><br><i>Gushakisha kwihariye</i> - Igerageza gushakisha izina ry'ukoresha mu bubiko bwa LDAP ikoresheje Izina Riranga (DN) ryihariye n'Ijambobanga ryihariye mu guhuza kugira ngo ibone Izina Riranga (DN) ry'ukoresha.<br><br><i>Amagambobanga akoreshwa rimwe (OTP/MFA)</i> - Cacti ihuza ijambobanga ry'ukoresha rimwe gusa, mu gihe cyo kwemeza umwirondoro bwa nyuma. <i>Nta gushakisha</i> ntikora ishakisha mu bubiko kandi ihuza mu buryo butaziguye ikoresheje inyandikorugero ya Izina Riranga (DN), bityo ikaba yizewe kuri OTP igihe inyandikorugero ya DN yonyine igaragaza ukoresha. Iyo gushakisha mu bubiko bikenewe kugira ngo haboneke DN, koresha <i>Gushakisha kwihariye</i> hamwe na konti ya serivisi yihariye (cyangwa <i>Gushakisha bitazwi</i> aho ububiko bubyemera) kugira ngo ishakisha ritigera rikoresha kode y'ukoresha ikoreshwa rimwe. Ku mikoreshereze ihamye ya OTP, koresha izina rimwe rya DNS igabanya umutwaro mu mwanya wa Seriveri aho gukoresha urutonde rwa seriveri nyinshi zitandukanyijwe n'umwanya, ibyo bikaba byakongera kugerageza guhuza hakoreshejwe ijambobanga rikoreshwa rimwe ryamaze gukoreshwa."

#: user_domains.php
msgid "Search base for searching the LDAP directory, such as <i>\"dc=win2kdomain,dc=local\"</i> or <i>\"ou=people,dc=domain,dc=local\"</i>."
msgstr "Ishingiro ry'ishakisha ryo gushakisha mu bubiko bwa LDAP, nka <i>\"dc=win2kdomain,dc=local\"</i> cyangwa <i>\"ou=people,dc=domain,dc=local\"</i>."

#: user_domains.php
msgid "Search filter to use to locate the user in the LDAP directory, such as for windows: <i>\"(&amp;(objectclass=user)(objectcategory=user)(userPrincipalName=&lt;username&gt;*))\"</i> or for OpenLDAP: <i>\"(&(objectClass=account)(uid=&lt;username&gt))\"</i>.  \"&lt;username&gt\" is replaced with the username that was supplied at the login prompt."
msgstr "Akayunguruzo ko gushakisha gakoreshwa mu kubona ukoresha mu bubiko bwa LDAP, nko kuri Windows: <i>\"(&amp;(objectclass=user)(objectcategory=user)(userPrincipalName=&lt;username&gt;*))\"</i> cyangwa kuri OpenLDAP: <i>\"(&(objectClass=account)(uid=&lt;username&gt))\"</i>.  \"&lt;username&gt\" isimburwa n'izina ry'ukoresha ryatanzwe mu gihe cyo kwinjira."

