#: utilities.php
msgid "Cacti technical support page.  Used by developers and technical support persons to assist with issues in Cacti.  Includes checks for common configuration issues."
msgstr "Urupapuro rw'ubufasha bwa tekiniki rwa Cacti. Rukoreshwa n'abahanga mu gukora porogaramu hamwe n'abatanga ubufasha bwa tekiniki mu gukemura ibibazo muri Cacti. Rurimo igenzura ry'ibibazo bisanzwe by'igenamiterere."

#: utilities.php
msgid "The Cacti Log stores statistic, error and other message depending on system settings.  This information can be used to identify problems with the poller and application."
msgstr "Inyandiko y'ibikorwa ya Cacti ibika imibare, amakosa n'ubundi butumwa bitewe n'igenamiterere rya sisitemu. Aya makuru ashobora gukoreshwa mu kumenya ibibazo biri muri Poller no muri porogaramu."

#: utilities.php
msgid "Allows Administrators to browse the user log.  Administrators can filter and export the log as well."
msgstr "Yemerera abayobozi gusuzuma inyandiko y'ibikorwa y'umukoresha. Abayobozi bashobora kandi gushungura no kohereza hanze iyo nyandiko y'ibikorwa."

#: utilities.php
msgid "Poller Cache Administration"
msgstr "Ubuyobozi bw'ububiko bw'agateganyo bwa Poller"

#: utilities.php
msgid "This is the data that is being passed to the poller each time it runs. This data is then in turn executed/interpreted and the results are fed into the RRDfiles for graphing or the database for display."
msgstr "Aya ni amakuru yoherezwa kuri Poller buri gihe ikoze. Aya makuru hanyuma arakorwa/agasobanurwa maze ibisubizo bigashyirwa mu madosiye ya RRD kugira ngo bikorwemo ibishushanyo cyangwa mu bubiko bw'amakuru kugira ngo byerekanwe."

#: utilities.php
msgid "The Data Query Cache stores information gathered from Data Query input types. The values from these fields can be used in the text area of Graphs for Legends, Vertical Labels, and GPRINTS as well as in CDEF's."
msgstr "Ububiko bw'agateganyo bw'ishakisha ry'amakuru bubika amakuru yakusanyijwe avuye mu bwoko bw'ibyinjizwa by'ishakisha ry'amakuru. Uduciro tuva muri iyi myanya dushobora gukoreshwa mu mwanya w'inyandiko w'ibishushanyo ku bisobanuro, ibirango bihagaritse, na GPRINT kimwe no muri CDEF."

#: utilities.php
msgid "Rebuild Poller Cache"
msgstr "Kubaka bundi bushya ububiko bw'agateganyo bwa Poller"

#: utilities.php
msgid "The Poller Cache will be re-generated if you select this option. Use this option only in the event of a database crash if you are experiencing issues after the crash and have already run the database repair tools.  Alternatively, if you are having problems with a specific Device, simply re-save that Device to rebuild its Poller Cache.  There is also a command line interface equivalent to this command that is recommended for large systems."
msgstr "Ububiko bw'agateganyo bwa Poller buzongera gukorwa nuhitamo iyi mpitamo. Koresha iyi mpitamo gusa igihe ububiko bw'amakuru bwangiritse niba ufite ibibazo nyuma y'iryo yangirika kandi wamaze gukoresha ibikoresho byo gusana ububiko bw'amakuru. Bitabaye ibyo, niba ufite ibibazo ku gikoresho runaka, ongera ubitse gusa icyo gikoresho kugira ngo wubake bundi bushya ububiko bwacyo bw'agateganyo bwa Poller. Hari kandi n'uburyo bw'umurongo w'amategeko (CLI) buhwanye n'iri tegeko risabwa kuri sisitemu nini."

#: utilities.php
msgid "NOTE: On large systems, this command may take several minutes to hours to complete and therefore should not be run from the Cacti UI.  You can simply run 'php -q cli/rebuild_poller_cache.php --help' at the command line for more information."
msgstr "ICYITONDERWA: Kuri sisitemu nini, iri tegeko rishobora gufata iminota myinshi kugeza ku masaha menshi kugira ngo rirangire bityo ntirikwiye gukorerwa ku rubuga rwa Cacti. Ushobora gukoresha gusa 'php -q cli/rebuild_poller_cache.php --help' ku murongo w'amategeko kugira ngo ubone amakuru arambuye."

#: utilities.php
msgid "Rebuild Resource Cache"
msgstr "Kubaka bundi bushya ububiko bw'agateganyo bw'umutungo"

#: utilities.php
msgid "When operating multiple Data Collectors in Cacti, Cacti will attempt to maintain state for key files on all Data Collectors.  This includes all core, non-install related website and plugin files.  When you force a Resource Cache rebuild, Cacti will clear the local Resource Cache, and then rebuild it at the next scheduled poller start.  This will trigger all Remote Data Collectors to recheck their website and plugin files for consistency."
msgstr "Igihe ukoresha abakusanyamakuru benshi muri Cacti, Cacti izagerageza kubungabunga imiterere y'amadosiye y'ingenzi ku bakusanyamakuru bose. Ibi birimo amadosiye yose y'ingenzi y'urubuga n'imigereka itari iyo kwishyiriramo. Igihe uhatiye kubaka bundi bushya ububiko bw'agateganyo bw'umutungo, Cacti izasiba ububiko bw'agateganyo bw'umutungo bw'imbere, hanyuma ibwubake bundi bushya ku itangira rya Poller riteganijwe ritaha. Ibi bizatuma abakusanyamakuru bose ba kure bongera kugenzura niba amadosiye yabo y'urubuga n'imigereka bihuye neza."

