#: utilities.php
msgid "RRDfile Cleaner"
msgstr "Igisukura RRDfile"

#: utilities.php
msgid "When you delete Data Sources from Cacti, the corresponding RRDfiles are not removed automatically.  Use this utility to facilitate the removal of these old files."
msgstr "Iyo usibye amasoko y'amakuru muri Cacti, amadosiye ya RRD ajyana nayo ntabwo asibwa mu buryo bwikora. Koresha iki gikoresho kugira ngo worohereze isibwa ry'aya madosiye ashaje."

#: utilities.php
