msgstr "Koresha iki gikoresho kugira ngo ugaragaze ibibazo by'amadosiye ya RRD abura cyangwa indangagaciro zibura mu madosiye ya RRD. Ugomba kwemeza rrdcheck muri Igenamiterere->Amagenamiterere->Amakuru"

